("8914","1741","_our_story_title_ha","field_695bb95e9bc5f"),
("8915","1741","our_story_ha","Founded in 2017 in Kolkata, Elvira Infotech began with a small team of three professionals and a strong vision for growth. Over the years, the company expanded across key technology hubs in the city, strengthening its team and capabilities. Today, operating from our own office at Imagine Techpark, Sector V, we are powered by a team of 40+ professionals. The journey of growth, challenges, and learning has shaped a resilient organization focused on long-term value."),
