("9251","1744","title_ha"," About <span class=\"blue_text\">Us</span>"),
("9252","1744","_title_ha","field_695bb88c9bc59"),
("9253","1744","description_ha","Elvira Infotech is a technology-driven digital solutions company delivering web, marketing, and AI-enabled services for modern businesses. We focus on building scalable, performance-oriented solutions that align with real business objectives. Our approach combines technical expertise, structured processes, and a commitment to quality. As an ISO 9001 certified company, we follow globally recognized standards to ensure consistent and reliable delivery."),
