("631","1","2019-09-04 13:09:46","2019-09-04 13:09:46","If you have free time, take a sit with an SEO expert and ask what\'s the most scared them most and we are pretty sure the answer will be \"De-Indexed by Google\". Yes, indeed it is a terrible thing and nightmare for any SEO service provider. The reason behind this is there\'s no cheat sheet that an SEO manager can use to hunt the exact problem. The website can be de-indexed for an unknown reason and it might take a lot of time and resources to fix the problem. We as a digital marketing services company been providing SEO service for quite a while now and we did face this issue on several occasions, however, thanks to our SEO team, we were able to hunt down the problem and were able to fix the issue promptly. We have talked with our SEO experts and today we are sharing a few reasons which make the website be de-indexed by Google.\r\n\r\nFirst of all, let\'s make sure the fault is not from your end. Many times developers turn off indexing so that they can work on the website. However, it has been found that after completion of the work, they forget to turn, back it on and result in no indexing problem. There is also a chance that during development or code review process someone indexed the website from the backend. Though this method seems pretty simple and hard to miss, however, it happens quite often. If everything is fine in the backend, let\'s jump into more complicated instances.\r\n\r\nMost people understand to rank great in the search engine a website must have both incoming and outgoing links. However, it doesn\'t mean you can spam the internet with the link in forums that are not related to the businesses\' service or products at all. If you have been following this practice, it is highly likely you went too far and Google\'s crawler flagged your practice which is lead to being indexed. Google red flags links if you are adding a link too fast or buying links or other discouraged actions. If you have been playing smart by hiding your link with a white background or similar, you can get blacklisted. Are you participating in link farming? If yes, then stop it now because the search giant can detect it easily. These can black hat SEO practice can be found by auditing your backlink profiles. Make sure you are doing it the right way to avoid getting a slap from Google.\r\n\r\nAt this point, be honest with yourself. Have you been misleading your users by offering mischievous information to woo more users? Sneaky tactics, keywords stuffing is a common method that is being used to redirect more traffic. However, this is bad for your business and website\'s future. Because these practices are not authorized by Google and yes, you can get a penalty for it. If you really want to boost your traffic, use the techniques used by a professional digital marketing services company. Yes, it will take some time to drive more traffic, but at least you will be able to sleep well at night!\r\n\r\nIn the end, we would like to say that most of the time the website is due-Indexed by Google only if the SEO practice is not fair. If you think your backend is clear from any possible problem, audit your website and find the mistake to solve the problem ASAP. De-Indexed, if running for a long time can lead to a more devastating result. If you can\'t find anything, get in touch with a professional SEO service provider like Elvira Infotech, one of the best SEO service provider in India with exceptional experience in the domain of SEO and digital marketing services. <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Get in touch now</strong></a>!","Recover Your Website if De-Indexed by Google","","publish","open","open","","recover-your-website-if-de-indexed-by-google","","","2026-01-12 08:16:22","2026-01-12 08:16:22","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/recover-your-website-if-de-indexed-by-google/","0","post","","0"),
("632","1","2019-09-09 13:51:39","2019-09-09 13:51:39","If you are a business owner who doesnâ€™t have its own app, youâ€™re missing out on a tremendous number of opportunities. Over the years, the number of people glued to their smartphones has grown exponentially, which basically means youâ€™re more inclined to reach your clients on their mobile devices than on most other platforms.\r\n\r\nA survey conducted by independent research organizations found that people nowadays spend more time on their smartphones than on TVs, with almost 75% of them checking their smartphones every hour. Nonetheless, some entrepreneurs are still not sure whether to invest in this platform.\r\n\r\nFortunately, this post will walk you through how you can expand your business revenue via mobile apps.\r\n\r\n<strong>Boost branding:</strong> Mobile applications present an efficient way to keep clients engaged. It enables you to interact with your clients in real-time, share the newest updates, new product launches, promotional vouchers, and discounts.\r\n\r\nSince your businessâ€™s logo and or slogan are visible on your clientsâ€™ smartphone, itâ€™s almost impossible not to memorize your business name whenever they require your services/products. It also presents a clear advantage against your competitors who are yet to adopt this business strategy. If you want an instant brand boost or recognition, producing a mobile application is an excellent way of assisting you to enhance your corporate branding and overall brand reputation.\r\n\r\n<strong>Boost customer service:</strong> Your clients can profit from being capable to access your products/services anytime they need and while on the move. This is particularly helpful if you donâ€™t have a direct helpline thatâ€™s accessible 24/7. Your app can include a feature where they can contact you at any time, or simply they can leave any suggestions, review or grievance so you can pursue later.\r\n\r\n<strong>Acquire more customers:</strong>Â Remember, todayâ€™s customers are moving constantly and are practically addicted to their smartphones. Without any doubt, they would enjoy a useful and pleasant mobile app for your business. If your app encourages them to save or kill time or is just that wonderful, they would even refer you to their colleagues, friends, and family. If you are worried about how much it might cost you, <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/07/02/how-much-does-it-cost-to-build-a-mobile-app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>we have covered that here</strong></a>.\r\n\r\n<strong>Generate more ROI:</strong> A mobile application with eCommerce capacity can easily provide another revenue platform, aside from your website and or brick and mortar shop. For instance, functionality to make eatery reservations, book concert tickets, buy services and goods, etc. are possible with a few taps here and there. But wait, thereâ€™s more! You can additionally earn by charging app users when they upgrade, or by offering in-app ads, etc.\r\n\r\n<strong>Engage more customers and personalize marketing:</strong> Mobile Apps can assist in engaging clients much better through push notifications by giving tailor offers based on the choice of the customers. Mobile apps can be used for designing loyalty awards where clients will be given coupons or reward points based on the number of their purchases. The loyalty programs promote repeat sales and help in client retention.\r\n\r\nBusiness applications made by professional web developers also make it easy for you to blend the latest technologies in attempts to add value. For example, you can have clients pay for purchases in your app using a Credit/ Debit card, Mobile wallet, internet banking and more which would be more convenient for your clients and help you to grow your business. Need more information? <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get in touch with Elvira Infotech now</a></strong>! We are here to serve your digital needs.","5 ways Mobile Application can boost your business","","publish","closed","closed","","5-ways-mobile-application-can-boost-your-business","","","2026-01-12 08:16:16","2026-01-12 08:16:16","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/5-ways-mobile-application-can-boost-your-business/","0","post","","0"),
("633","1","2019-09-16 08:19:20","2019-09-16 08:19:20","Whether you have USD500 monthly budget or a hefty USD50000, your budget won\'t always determine your success unless you recognize what\'s best for your business. Whatever your investment amount might be, as an entrepreneur you will be looking out to maximize your ROI through your investment.\r\n\r\nPicking up a suitable marketing channel will definitely help you to boost your business. However, how do you know which one is best for your <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>digital marketing needs</strong></a>? If you are not certain about which channel or platform you must use, don\'t worry. We can help you to choose the best ones. Yes, there are more than one platform and today we will talk about the top 3 platforms for lead generation.\r\n\r\n<strong>Social Media:</strong> Without any doubt, social media is now a huge player in the field of digital marketing. Prospects are most of the time spending their free time on platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, etc, browsing through feeds and searching to fulfill their desire. Social media can further draw more customers towards your website which will definitely boost your SEO ranking as well. There are more than 3 Billion people are actively browsing through social media. That\'s almost half the population of our planet itself! And guess what, with the right tactics and by understanding the user\'s need you can efficiently target each one of them. The best thing about social media marketing is this comes with great analytics applications that can be used to find quality prospects and each one of them is absolutely free. However, if you want to see the best outcome, it is adviced that you get in touch with a <a href=\"mailto:info@elvirainfotech.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>digital marketing company</strong></a>.\r\n\r\n<strong>Search Engine optimization:</strong> 9 out of 10 people make use of a search engine before coming to any purchasing decision. Considering there are 4.3 billion people who have an active internet connection, you can realize the potential. For beginners, SEO stands for search engine optimization, and itâ€™s the means of promoting a website in techniques that help it stand in search results when users search for particular words and phrases or better known as keywords. If youâ€™re not certain why this matters, just think regarding how you frequently get the information you require during your everyday life. If youâ€™re like most people, youâ€™d reach for your phone or sit down at your workstation and type a simple keyword into Google, Bing or other search engines. Youâ€™d search â€œbest mobile phone,â€ â€œIndian restaurants near me,â€ or â€œEasy learn Spanish.â€ Then, youâ€™d scroll through the SERP results and click the one that looked best fit to your requirements. These results are based on what the search giants think will be the most significant data to you, based on the keywords you typed in the search button. But in the most instances, the websites you see on the first page didnâ€™t get there by accident. They used SEO to help Google recognize what their content is about. And with the help of SEO experts, your business can make into top position to obtain the huge number of prospect and ROI.\r\n\r\n<strong>PPC Marketing:</strong> There are two dominating forces in the world of PPC: Google Ads and Instagram/ Facebook. Google search ads will help you connect with users who are searching for services or products like yours. On the other hand, display ads and Facebook ads will enable you to create demand and introduce your services to customers who may not be looking or even know you exist.\r\n\r\nThere are two dominating forces in the world of PPC: Google Ads and Instagram/ Facebook. Google search ads will help you connect with users who are searching for services or products like yours. On the other hand, display ads and Facebook ads will enable you to create interest and introduce your products and services to clients who may not be looking or even know you exist!\r\n\r\nWhile all the above three platforms are great in their way, marketers and entrepreneurs must brainstorm and hunt for the specific platforms, as well as how their brands need to be placed and marketed. If you simply tart forsaking of starting it, without a proper plan, you will end up losing a lot of cash and time and resource without gaining the proper outcome.","The Top 3 Marketing Channels You Should Prioritize To Maximize Lead Generation","","publish","open","open","","the-top-3-marketing-channels-you-should-prioritize-to-maximize-lead-generation","","","2026-01-12 08:16:11","2026-01-12 08:16:11","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/the-top-3-marketing-channels-you-should-prioritize-to-maximize-lead-generation/","0","post","","0"),
("634","1","2019-09-24 14:13:34","2019-09-24 14:13:34","Content Management System or better recognized CMS is a software program used in managing a website. Oftentimes you don\'t have to keep the knowledge of HTML code or web languages in order to use a CMS. There are several CMS software to choose from and some of the most popular CMS is open source or free. All but one of the top-rated CMS systems we have included are from the winners of the CMSWire contest and the top hits from opensource.com.\r\n\r\n<strong>Wordpress:</strong> A well-recognized name in the field of the content management system, Wordpress is the ultimate platform for the web. Both Wikipedia and Gobala Krishnan in WebPro News believe that Wordpress has expanded beyond being an open-source blogging tool to becoming a CMS. Websites of all shapes and sizes nowadays use Wordpress and the reason is, Wordpress is quite modular and it has one of the best SEO tools that can be used to boost your online presence for free. If you want to know more about <strong>SEO</strong> or \"<strong>how it can help you to grow your business</strong>\", <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/06/24/key-benefits-of-seo-for-restaurant-websites/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>you can visit here</strong></a>. Coming back to Wordpress, today the public plugin inventory has more than 40,000+ free plugins, while the public WordPress theme database has over 2,100+ styles to choose from.\r\n\r\n<strong>Joomla:</strong> It is a free, multifunctional content management system or CMS that delivers exceptional results. Due to its efficiency, it has an ever-growing community of more than 40,000 active users and developers. It\'s simplistic, the browser-based interface makes it simple to add content pages to your website. For various people, Joomla\'s appeal is its capability to be modified with the several hundreds of ingredient add-ons and plugins that can be attached to the website system framework. This way your website can be personalized to meet your needs. Also, Joomla does a good job of managing the web content required to run the website.\r\n\r\n<strong>Drupal:</strong> It is an open-source platform that is written in PHP and needs a MySQL database. It is an exceptional, lightweight, adaptable system that can be used to develop a variety of websites from blogs to large community-driven websites. Drupal\'s simplistic design is comfortable to personalize and it has a built-in search tool and SEO friendly URLs as an extra add on module.\r\n\r\nDrupal has numerous features for creating community sites. So, it would be a great alternative for a blogging or news site, but it can also support a standard website.\r\n\r\n<strong>Plone:</strong> It is a free tool and easy to install software, with full-featured &amp; flexible enterprise-ready CMS. Although, if you need to add an add-on you must have a good knowledge of Python and web programming. Even if you just use the default installation, you will have a very full-featured website to use. Plone is built on top of Zope and has much of the extensibility that Zope has to offer. Plone would be a good choice for someone who is familiar with programming and needs a flexible, scalable CMS.\r\n\r\n<strong>Mambo:</strong> Once identified as Mambo Open Source or MOS, is a free, simple to use CMS. Mambo has brought numerous users through its ease in adding and managing web pages. It\'s more superior features such as page caching, advanced templating systems and robust API has brought users who are looking for a more complex website. Mambo also offers RSS feeds, forums, polls, blogs, news flashes, etc.\r\nThe above names are most well known and there are many. If you are on the verge of building a website, you might also be interested in knowing a few website design aspects as well. <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/06/07/why-is-web-design-important/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click here to know the importance of website designing</strong></a>. Want to talk to an expert web developer before choosing the best CMS? <a href=\"mailto:info@elvirainfotech.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Contact Elvira Infotech</strong></a>, one of the best web development companies in India serving worldwide customers, our experts are waiting to answer your call. Get in touch with us now.","Top 5 CMS to use for your next website project","","publish","open","open","","top-5-cms-to-use-for-your-next-website-project","","","2026-01-12 08:16:06","2026-01-12 08:16:06","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/top-5-cms-to-use-for-your-next-website-project/","0","post","","0"),
("635","1","2019-10-10 13:12:40","2019-10-10 13:12:40","With the introduction of the internet and eCommerce, business trends have undergone a transformation. The Internet has grown into one of the most common platforms for marketing and promotion of services and products. eCommerce is unquestionably the most reliable way to attract new prospects throughout the globe. Nevertheless, if you have a WordPress website and need to expand its web presence, WooCommerce development can help you in the best possible way.\r\n\r\n<strong>What is wooCommerce?\r\n</strong>\r\nWooCommerce is a great open-source eCommerce plug-in that aids in bringing more clients on a WordPress website and encourage sales. This powerful and effective plug-in is flexible, scalable and easily accessible. Any WordPress user who desires to make his/her eCommerce website feature-rich, can opt-in for wooCommerce plugin. Reputed outsourcing agencies offer personalized and affordable wooCommerce development services to improve an eCommerce store with tailored theme designs. If you want to know about the necessity of having an aesthetically pleasing website, you can <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/06/07/why-is-web-design-important/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">visit here</a></strong>.\r\n\r\n<strong>Aspects that make WooCommerce the best ecommerce platform:</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>It is Free:</strong> Maybe the most essential benefit! It is Free: It is a free open source plugin. Its extra add-ons and support further cost less compared to other carts. Therefore, it reduces your overall business expenses, making this plugin ideal for small businesses and start-ups.\r\n\r\n<strong>Huge Flexibility:</strong> It\'s definite that one of WooCommerce\'s most important benefits to e-commerce newcomers is that entrepreneur utilizing the program can use a whole lot of personalization with their services and products, without needing to about technical specs.\r\nProducts can be itemized, given sale costs, autonomous attributes, and more without needing to write complicated codes. Furthermore, WooCommerce stores are experts in selling physical, virtual, downloadable and ALSO affiliate/external products.\r\n\r\n<strong>Great Analytics:</strong> The primary tool utilized by any owner is their analytics tool. Various eCommerce startups may not have a sense of how to implement an analytics tool to their website, nor will they know what statistics needed for the analysis. Luckily, WooCommerce has covered such merchants.\r\n\r\nA built-in analytics system forms an extensive array of statistics crystal clear. Crucial information like total sales, sales by time and date, average order totals, specific client statistics and much more are all tidily displayed via graphs, without the user ever having to leave their admin panel.\r\n\r\n<strong>Professional yet simple:</strong> Professional yet simple: Free means bad, it\'s a general misconception of many people and Woocommerce proved it greatly. Although it\'s a free and user-friendly program, you must keep away the myths if you have any, and you should not think that it is not professional enough. Inbuilt with the platform is a detailed order-tracking facility with customer engagement tools that enable the purchaser to view past and open orders.\r\n\r\n<strong>Scope for growth:</strong> Like other eCommerce extensions, it further enables its users to exercise growth and expansion in terms of how you handle your products, store, and customers\' experience.\r\n\r\nWooCommerce has been in the field for a while, encouraging users to get exceptional WordPress themes, extensions and plugins. Being a reliable and efficient eCommerce platform, WooCommerce can be the most suitable alternative if builds by an experienced <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>WooCommerce development company</strong></a> like Elvira Infotech. If you want to know more about eCommerce website development or need price estimation, <a href=\"mailto:info@elvirainfotech.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>get in touch with us now</strong></a>.","Woocommerce - The Right Solution For Your Ecommerce Needs","","publish","open","open","","woocommerce-the-right-solution-for-your-ecommerce-needs","","","2026-01-12 08:15:58","2026-01-12 08:15:58","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/woocommerce-the-right-solution-for-your-ecommerce-needs/","0","post","","0"),
