developing-an-ios-app-is-a-valuable-investment-for-your-business","","","2026-01-12 08:13:27","2026-01-12 08:13:27","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/why-developing-an-ios-app-is-a-valuable-investment-for-your-business/","0","post","","0"),
("650","1","2020-05-26 14:53:35","2020-05-26 14:53:35","Most of the entrepreneurs do give a thought regarding having a Mobile App for their organization. However, when they begin thinking on this ground, many questions appear in their minds. How much budget they have to allocate? What would be the time frame to develop and launch the app? Should I go for an App that will work on the Android platform, or is it better to go for the iOS platform or both? The most suitable solution to all of your enigmas is Hybrid Apps. These Apps can be developed fast, needs a relatively lower budget, as against Native Apps.\r\n\r\n<strong>What is Hybrid App?</strong>\r\n\r\nUnlike Native Apps, which made solely for running on a specific mobile platform, like Android or iOS, Hybrid Apps are being developed to work on various platforms, which include Android, iOS, and Windows. These apps are built by making use of HTML, CSS, &amp; JavaScript. They are instead a list of Web pages referring to a Website, created to work on smaller screens.\r\n\r\nTransforming the existing Web pages into App screens, without needing to build new pages for an App, can itself become a compelling motivation to understand that these Apps are time-saving as well as cost-saving. Let us further glance at why the kind of Mobile App development has earned popularity between Business owners and Hybrid App developers.\r\n\r\n<strong>A Single Version of Hybrid App can work on multiple Mobile Platforms</strong>\r\n\r\nThe most appreciated feature of these Apps is, it is made only once to work on diverse Mobile platforms, unlike Native Apps, which need different versions to change from one platform to another. Nevertheless, one question which appears in any prospective Mobile App owner\'s thought is, a Native App, when made to work on a particular Mobile platform, can look great and work well for that specific platform. While the same Hybrid App, when working on separate Mobile platforms, would it be capable enough of delivering the same level of User experience, as seen in a Natively developed app for a particular platform?\r\n\r\nThe answer is if a Hybrid App developed by well experienced app development company is built with lots of multimedia or vibrant graphics. It is tough to find out that it is a Hybrid App, which is not exclusively meant for the dedicated platform on which they are currently operating. It can very well work on any platform, with a luxurious look and unique User experience, just as it appears with a Native App for a unique Mobile platform.\r\n\r\n<strong>Leverages the existing skills </strong>\r\n\r\nIn the case of Hybrid Apps, for transforming the existing Web pages into a Mobile App, a developer doesn\'t always have to learn new techniques. With the current understanding of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, an experienced web developer can develop a Mobile App for any business. The developers can bypass the phase of learning complex languages like Objective C for the development of Mobile Apps for iOS platforms.\r\n\r\nEven if developers do acquire new abilities for building Native Apps, the method of development can still be time- consuming and costly. In addition to various builds, in the future, any updates to the current Mobile App has to be done individually for various Mobile platforms. This will eventually become an extremely daunting task for Mobile Application developers.\r\n\r\nElvira Infotech, is one of the renowned companies, offering top notch services in Mobile Application Development and <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Web Design and Development</strong></a>. The company\'s core specializations include, Hybrid Mobile Applications, PHP based Web Applications, Ecommerce Applications, and Content Management Systems. <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Contact us</strong></a> for more information.","Advantage of Hybrid Mobile Apps","","publish","open","open","","advantage-of-hybrid-mobile-apps","","","2026-01-12 08:12:43","2026-01-12 08:12:43","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/advantage-of-hybrid-mobile-apps/","0","post","","0"),
("651","1","2020-06-06 14:52:58","2020-06-06 14:52:58","Millions of websites of all kinds and sizes use WordPress to publish fresh content every second. WordPress powers almost&nbsp; 29% of all websites. This content management system has swiftly grown to be a choice among both web-savvy users and beginners alike because of how simple-but-powerful it is. If you are considering building a website, then you must start a website utilizing WordPress. If you are nevertheless sitting on the fence, find the following five ideas why WordPress is worth changing to if you havenâ€™t already.\r\n\r\n<strong>It is free and flexible: </strong>As a <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>web development company</strong></a>, we understand that building a custom site takes a lot of resources and cash. The same thing can be achieved through the WordPress site. Therefore, why not save some money with WordPress? There\'s no need to begin from scratch; WordPress can start the journey freely available and personalize. Like WordPress, the plug-ins that generally come with are most of the time do not charge for making use of it. These plug-ins are not only free but open source as well. Thus, you can always go through the codes to see how it works, and you can forever change according to your preference.\r\n\r\n<strong>SEO friendly: </strong>Major search engines like Google adore WordPress. Reasons? Well, because it consists of a well-written code. If you\'re thinking of a head start with SEO, WordPress is the way to go for. Adding fresh new content to your website through WordPress is relatively simple &amp; highly recommended. Therefore, you won\'t have to wait for someone tech-savvy to update your content.\r\n\r\n<strong>Affordable themes: </strong>Themes are what present WordPress its design; it\'s what unites the CMS to the front end. WordPress is exceptionally resilient and versatile. While there are some beautiful good free themes, I have found that for $20 bucks, the excellent premium themes are worth every penny. Most require almost no customization!\r\n\r\n<strong>Scalable: </strong>Plug-ins are add-ons that can be effortlessly installed in the WordPress dashboard. An area to add features that are not part of your sites\' core code. If you require a particular function or features that are not built-in, there are hundreds of plug-ins available to boost WordPress\' functionality. In almost every case, so there is likely a solution already developed for anything you crave for - the possibilities are limitless!\r\n\r\n<strong>A huge community: </strong>The world of open source is quite amazing. Filled with independent developers and contributors, always striving to make changes to create a platform that is efficient, amazing, and feature-rich. WordPress is open-source; therefore, you will find thousands of people contributing to make it better. What does this mean? Well, this means fewer bugs, lowest numbers of backdoors, and undoubtedly several amazing features. Here, you will never be held ransom by anyone designer or developer. YOU own your website!\r\n\r\nAs a <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>WordPress development company</strong></a>, the above five reasons is our favourite. However, there are many. What strikes us most is the simplicity of the platform. You won\'t need anyone to spoon feed you on every single step. The CMS is amazingly simple and quite self-explanatory. Therefore, you can always update new content whenever you want to be.","5 Reasons Why You Should Build Your Website On WordPress","","publish","open","open","","5-reasons-why-you-should-build-your-website-on-wordpress","","","2026-01-12 08:12:37","2026-01-12 08:12:37","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/5-reasons-why-you-should-build-your-website-on-wordpress/","0","post","","0"),
("652","1","2020-06-20 11:20:45","2020-06-20 11:20:45","Several studies have revealed that a vast percentage of modern users favour mobile commerce apps to e-commerce websites. Therefore, your e-commerce website needs to deliver an optimal user experience to beat the competition and mobile commerce.\r\n\r\nYou have to consider several factors to make the web store keep guests involved and attract them to purchase the products/services. Besides concentrating the look, feel, features, and functionality of the website, you likewise require to investigate ways to optimize its user experience. To maximize the user experience passed by the site, you need to increase its accessibility, usability, safety, reliability, and search engine visibility.\r\n\r\n<strong>User:</strong> While designing and building your first eCommerce site, you need to concentrate broadly on the users and their preferences. It would help if you identified that a web store does not enable customers to touch, feel, or smell the goods physically. Therefore, you must find new users interested in making their shopping adventure fast and hassle-free. You can continuously keep the prospects engaged &amp; interested by offering products at reduced prices, presenting free shipping, and holding the shopping and checkout process simple.\r\n\r\n<strong>Social media:</strong> You want to incorporate multiple social elements on the eCommerce website to influence prospects. The visitors must have the choice to share the goods bought from your online store through popular social networks. Additionally, the social elements will encourage users to market your brand-new eCommerce website and improve its popularity. You can even utilize social media features as a useful tool to gather information about clients and track their behaviour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Payments: </strong>The variety of online payment alternatives ranges from one consumer to another. Some buyers favor making payment through their debit/credit cards or internet banking tools, while others opt for popular online payment alternatives like PayPal and digital wallets. Therefore, you want to assure that every buyer can make payment for the products bought by him with any payment choice. Likewise, it would be best if you kept the online payment and business transactions of clients secure by utilizing a secure payment gateway and the most advanced encryption techniques.\r\n\r\n<strong>SEO: </strong>With the help of a digital marketing company, you can easily divert regular search engine traffic to your newly built eCommerce site. But, before you begin SEO optimization, you have to comply with the search engine rules. For example, the search giant Google ranks websites based on metrics such as mobile-friendliness, load time, content, etc. Also, the search engine company insists on making web stores with responsive web design. While planning the eCommerce website, you have to keep in mind the regular guidelines and recommendations of major online search engines. If you do not want to get involved in this complicated part, hire a professional web development company like <strong>Elvira Infotech</strong>, who has a digital marketing team at their disposal.\r\n\r\n<strong>Trust: </strong>Credibility is essential to get success out of your eCommerce business. Hence it is imperative to find out new dimensions to boost the credibility of your site. Besides adding robust security in place, you also need to showcase accreditation certificatesÂ  &amp; trust marks of reputed brands. The trust mark will give your prospect confidence in doing business with you. It will also ensure the customers that you will keep the personal data safe.\r\n\r\nMoreover, you need to evaluate all necessary perspectives - user interface, features, performance, usability, safety, and user experience - through the eCommerce website development stage itself to make it available within a shorter measure of time. You can even examine spending in analytics tools to understand website visitors\' habits and choices based on real-time data collected from various sources. However, it is likewise necessary to consistently update your eCommerce website to meet the emerging technologies, industry trends, and customer preferences.","5 Essential Points to Consider before Launching an E-commerce Website","","publish","open","open","","5-essential-points-to-consider-before-launching-an-e-commerce-website","","","2026-01-12 08:12:32","2026-01-12 08:12:32","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/5-essential-points-to-consider-before-launching-an-e-commerce-website/","0","post","","0"),
("653","1","2020-07-08 13:45:24","2020-07-08 13:45:24","Even if you have sufficient knowledge of SEO, you may still require an expert SEO company. Having a clear knowledge of SEO is hardly sufficient in some circumstances. Even if you are giving your best to attempt to achieve a great ranking for your site, you might still turn up questioning why your site is simply not performing the way it should be. For starters, you must realize that your website must be optimized in every aspect. Not just that, but your website has to be continuously maintained. SEO is a constant process that involves resources and time. To make things more manageable, you will be better off using a qualified SEO company to do the work for your website.\r\n\r\nThere are many SEO companies today, and there are a lot of reliable firms and irresponsible ones. Thus, you must choose the ideal SEO Company. Here are 5 basic points that you must keep in mind when choosing SEO services:\r\n\r\n<strong>The tools:</strong> What tools does the SEO company use to look for keywords? Do they give a competitive examination based on your preferred keywords? Recognizing what method the SEO company uses for keyword evaluation or examination is extremely necessary. It will be a big help if you make your due diligence utilizing necessary tools, such as conducting keyword research, including analysis using the <a href=\"https://ads.google.com/intl/en_in/home/tools/keyword-planner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>keyword planner</strong></a> in Google AdWords.\r\n\r\n<strong>Backlink: </strong>Where will the SEO Company deliver links from? Backlinks are essential in SEO than onsite optimization. The SEO Company must receive high-quality backlinks from reliable websites that are associated with your business. Ask your hired SEO firm what methods they use for gathering backlinks.\r\n\r\n<strong>The charges: </strong>A <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">good SEO company</a> will not be able to offer you an exact estimation. And if you think that you can win the love of Google only by spending a lot more, you are not thinking straight. Without a proper SEO strategy, no website will stay on the top SERP, no matter how much you spend on it. Therefore it is advised to be flexible about the cost and charges. If an SEO agency needs a tool, they might charge you more. It is for your good.\r\n\r\n<strong>Report: </strong>A complete report must be provided to show the development of the SEO drive and the latest status of the ranks and overall development. They must offer you this report weekly or at least monthly. The report a professional SEO company offer is clear and concise. To make sure that anyone can understand the development and improvements.\r\n\r\n<strong>The growth: </strong>Does the SEO Company offer any guarantee? For instance, a periodic percentage boost in traffic? Although there are several circumstances involved in an SEO campaign, a professional SEO firm will offer you a rough estimation of the growth.\r\n\r\nThese are the most important aspects while you are searching for an <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>SEO service company</strong></a>. Keep these points with you, and you will have a fantastic experience.","5 Secrets to Hiring the Right SEO Company","","publish","open","open","","5-secrets-to-hiring-the-right-seo-company","","","2026-01-12 08:11:23","2026-01-12 08:11:23","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/5-secrets-to-hiring-the-right-seo-company/","0","post","","0"),
("654","1","2020-09-05 10:29:32","2020-09-05 10:29:32","<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Mobile phones have become an\r\nessential part of our lives. People of all ages and groups are now connected to\r\nothers from across the world, all thanks to the advancement of the latest\r\nsmartphone technology. Smartphones are virtual PCs that you can carry around in\r\nyour pocket comfortably. These mobile phones not only enable you to talk to\r\nanother person but also present you with a world of information, all in the\r\npalm of your hands.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>Spread of\r\nthe Smartphone</strong></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>According to a statement by\r\nStatista, as of January 2020, there are over 3.5 billion individual mobile\r\nusers in the world. Moreover, thanks to the superior smartphone technology in\r\nuse today, mobile smartphones are considered for almost 50% of the total global\r\ninternet usage volume. There are various such facts and numbers which show\r\nprecisely the still-growing numbers of smartphone users worldwide.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>We all know that a smartphone is\r\nnothing without smartphone applications, or \'Apps,\' installed in it. Mobile\r\napps are solely software that is intended to run on mobile platforms, such as\r\nAndroid &amp; iOS. With the increase in numbers of smartphone users, mobile\r\napps have become an indispensable part of managing commerce, from the ground\r\nlevel up to the B2B level.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>Who needs\r\na Mobile App?</strong></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Who needs a mobile app, is one of the most commonly requested questions in the business sector today. Plainly speaking, a smartphone app is an exceptional way to make about all of your business functions efficiently. An ideal <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\">mobile app development organization</a></strong> like Elvira Infotech can design beautiful and easy-to-use mobile apps. These can be in the form of entertainment apps, educational apps, eCommerce apps, etc. Today, mobile apps have become an essential part of our day-to-day life. We have apps that help us to wake early in the morning, help to organize the whole day, apps that assist you to do a hundred various things throughout your entire day and even apps that encourage you to sleep at the end of the day.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Recognizing the tremendous\r\nefficiency, comfort and vital connectivity that smartphone mobile apps present\r\ntoday small and large businesses of all sorts are in search of the best custom\r\nAndroid app development company.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>Benefits\r\nof Mobile Apps in Business</strong></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>These are the specific advantages\r\nthat are recognized when you design, develop and launch a mobile app to conduct\r\nbusiness online:</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Benefits to Business - This is how your business will profit when you launch your dedicated app, with the guidance of the ideal Android application development company:</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Builds and Grows Customer Loyalty -\r\nApps helps businesses to formulate a close and constant connection with your\r\npotential, new and existing patrons.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Improves Brand Impact - Mobile apps\r\nare viewed and used hundreds of times by the users on their smartphone screens\r\nthrough the course of a single day. This is an efficient way to subconsciously\r\nrecord an impression on the user\'s perception, thus assisting to improve your\r\nbrand recognition and visibility.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Better Access - By sending important\r\nupdates such as limited-time discounts, offers, etc on your commercial apps,\r\nyou can enable users to make shopping efficiently and faster, at any time and\r\nfrom anywhere.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Constant Customer Connectivity -\r\nWith today\'s fast-paced lifestyle just providing enough time for traditional\r\nshopping at shops and malls, apps have grown the best way to make purchases on\r\nthe go.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>These, and numerous other such advantages, are the reasons that having an app is a necessity for all types of small and large businesses. Picking the most qualified <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact/\">app development company</a></strong> is essential as the quality of the app determines its effectiveness. Select an app development company that provides all-around app design, development, and maintenance services to ensure optimum profits in the end like Elvira Infotech.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","Benefits of Mobile Apps in Business","","publish","open","open","","benefits-of-mobile-apps-in-business","","","2026-01-12 08:11:18","2026-01-12 08:11:18","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/benefits-of-mobile-apps-in-business/","0","post","","0"),
("655","1","2020-09-19 13:07:23","2020-09-19 13:07:23","<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Are you thinking about having a website\r\nfor your business? That\'s great; however, many business owners forgot a few\r\nimportant aspects which ruin their goals. Today, we will explore those.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>A Call to Action.</strong>\r\nYour website guests have decided to visit your site for a particular reason.\r\nConsider your website is a marketing tool where users request more information,\r\nbuy a product, download an app, schedule a booking, etc. You must have a\r\nvisible and straightforward call to action button. Why? Well, so that your\r\nwebsite visitors don\'t leave your website &amp; take their business to one of\r\nyour competitors.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>Responsive Design. </strong>According\r\nto statistics, more than 60% of users come from portable devices. This means\r\nmore than half of the visitors to your business website may be coming from\r\nmobile devices. You want to present an immeasurable user experience for those\r\nwebsite visitors. There are a few parts that involve technicality to know how\r\nto build a responsive website. The basic concept is that you are bringing\r\nchanges to your website depending on the user\'s browser/system and how the\r\nwebsite visitor contracts or expands your website.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>Clear Contact Information. </strong>Even\r\ntoday, many websites make it challenging to contact the business quickly. Some\r\nof the largest companies in the world do make it challenging for a user to get\r\nthem as a way to reduce customer support costs. Unless your business has a\r\nmonopoly, I would strongly suggest making some form of contact with your\r\nbusiness easy. There are many different methods of communication, such as\r\nemail, web form, or live chat. So, it would be best if you offered some way for\r\na prospect or client to reach your business 24/7.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>A Secure Host and Website.</strong>\r\nYou must be certain that your host is at a safe data center with some options\r\nfor your website\'s back-ups. You should also keep a local back-up of your\r\nwebsite. One of the dangers of DIY website development or letting an amateur\r\ndevelop your website is that many security flaws can unintentionally be added\r\nto your website. We at Elvira Infotech have years of web development and web\r\nsecurity expertise in our hands. And we make use of them while we develop your\r\nown site. Our codes are sophisticated and can make secure your website and its\r\ndata from cyber attacks.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p><strong>Social Media Links. </strong>Social media is an excellent way to bring targeted users to your website. Through social media, one person liking your website could bring in hundreds or even thousands of new users if an item goes viral. Allowing your clients or customers to share your website\'s content to their network through social media links is very important. Adding opportunities to like and share through platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, Snapchat, YouTube, and LinkedIn can be a great way to rapidly grow your business.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>These five business website development ideas must be implemented to get maximum benefits and return. If you are looking to develop a top-notch website, <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact/\">get in touch with us.</a></strong> </p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","5 Things Your Business Website Should Have","","publish","open","open","","5-things-your-business-website-should-have","","","2026-01-12 08:10:43","2026-01-12 08:10:43","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/5-things-your-business-website-should-have/","0","post","","0"),
("656","1","2020-10-03 10:19:45","2020-10-03 10:19:45","<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Today, business organizations can nevermore overlook the online communities\' influence being the platform that supports them obtain excellent exposure and improve their brand visibility. Online social media platforms have come a long way. And today, it has become a fabulous way of reaching prospects most effectively without spending a lot of cash. Online platforms, especially social networking websites, millions of registered users, and the numbers grow each day rapidly.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Today, the social media giant Facebook has more than a billion users. Thousands of people are signing in and registering every day on twitter. Furthermore, platforms such as Instagram and Pinterest. And these social media sites are also growing significantly. And all of these platforms are now used as a means for businesses to showcase their services and products easily. Hence, it is not wrong to uphold that social media optimization for business has been the most exciting revolution that harnesses their growth in the most effective ways.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Needless to say that social media has numerous benefits for business. Out of many, the most significant one is that it enables businesses to reach a vast number of growth potentials. You have the power to get in touch with millions, if not billions, without much effort and interact with them to understand their needs and wants.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Advertising in online platforms means that online prospects can now effortlessly reach you. And the same platforms also offer you the opportunity to extend a quick response, making your clientele happy and increasing your goodwill. The most important thing you need to remember while trying to reach a vast number of prospects is to hire a good SEO company. Want to know how to a hire a good SEO company? You may find <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2020/07/08/5-secrets-to-hiring-the-right-seo-company/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"this blog (opens in a new tab)\">this blog</a></strong> helpful!</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>In Social media for business, online interaction between business and client is effortless and affordable. If you hire an experienced SMM service provider such as Elvira Infotech, your business can bring more significant results in terms of visibility and overall online presence. For instance, social media marketing campaigns, such as e-mail campaigning, social media posts, etc., can reach and appeal to a huge number of clients. An effective and smartly planned campaign has the power to turn a mere visitor into a buyer.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Most of the time, online users go to social media platforms to find reviews about a particular service provider. Therefore, posting reviews and asking your customers to give one is essential, and it is the right way to bring guests to your site. The SMM includes social media optimization services, which play a crucial role in product, services, or overall business promotion.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>The overall social media optimization services involve a wide range of promotional methods, which include article and press release submission, image or video uploads, interacting with the online audience by participating in the discussion forums, and loads of other stuff. SMO services\' main goal is to make proper brand awareness and directing maximum traffic to the website.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>As a whole, the social media marketing for business comes with numerous applications intended to draw different online users. The services that are provided by the SMM company focus on improving businesses\' online strategies and reach. A professional SMM organization formulate the correct social media policies &amp; help you with a different approach, which will help your business carve a separate niche.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\r\n\r\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>It is true that a good rank in search engine result pages aids an organization to enjoy high exposure. However, there are other essential factors related to it. Social media optimization services have grown and offered a great result to the business. As an entrepreneur, you have to be aware of the business goal you want to achieve through SMM. And by adhering to a strategic approach, it is a matter of time for your business to enjoy more recognition online.<br></p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","Why you should not overlook Social Media For Business","","publish","open","open","","why-you-should-not-overlook-social-media-for-business","","","2026-01-12 08:10:16","2026-01-12 08:10:16","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/why-you-should-not-overlook-social-media-for-business/","0","post","","0"),
("657","1","2020-10-31 14:25:06","2020-10-31 14:25:06","<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Mobile apps for MSMEs entrepreneurs are growing more popular as smaller firms have found that mobile apps are central foundations for marketing and marketing their business.<br><br>In the past, apps were solely accessible to well-known conglomerate and big corporations due to the enormous costs of producing a custom app. App developers used countless hours designing and coding the application to the organizations\' specific blueprints, which was the reason for the too high price tag. But, with the advent of automation and highly skilled developers, and new ways of coding, the technology has caught up with the trend, and now we have the collective capabilities to offer great apps at a low price.<br> <br>Right now, if you take a glance at your smartphone, you will find out that most of them are designed and developed to serve a specific purpose. For instance, some of them look through your email, weather reports, social media, work calendar,... etc. Then <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"mobile apps for business (opens in a new tab)\">mobile apps for business</a></strong> marketing came into existence. For instance, an app such as Amazon, Flipkart, where you can buy products and acquire different services. The business realized that the desktop market is going to reduce, and the smartphone will take place. Business marketers had developers create mobile apps for their businesses to take advantage of this new marketing strata.<br> <br>What do you see when you watch people in public places such as a mall or park? You will be observed that most of them will be glued down to their phones, interacting with someone or some business. Now it can be argued that this manner can be somewhat dangerous, particularly if you\'re not following where you are going. But that\'s another topic of conversation at some other time.<br> <br>However, here\'s what\'s renewing regarding a mobile business app. It can be referred to as an \"electronic business card.\" It is continuously in front of targeted customers. As the smartphone user scrolls through the apps, and if they have your app installed on the phone, they will see it many times a day. A business can only improve with that kind of mass exposure.<br> <br>For instance of how a mobile business app can give a lot of exposure, let ride a story! Here we have a customer, let\'s call him Michael, who has installed and from his local pizza place. Now he is having a party with few friends. And he places a pizza order from the app for a little gathering of friends at his house. Michael knows they make great pizza, and sure enough, one of his friends wants to know the name of the place where he got the pizza because it is NOT a major chain. Michael will say, \"the name of the pizza company is â€œthisâ€, and they have the app, andÂ  you can make effortlessly it from the store to order the great pizza.\"<br><br>Word of mouth still is one of the most efficient ways of advertising that money cannot buy. That pizza company picks up another client they never intended to get. When Michael\'s friend downloads the app, the pizza place is on his phone, and he will see many times during the day or night.<br><br>The mobile app brings a lot of benefits to the business, and the above one is one of many. If you want to build a mobile app for your own business at a low cost, get in touch with <strong><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Elvira Infotech now (opens in a new tab)\">Elvira Infotech now</a></strong>.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","The Need of Mobile Business Apps","","publish","open","open","","the-need-of-mobile-business-apps","","","2026-01-12 08:10:11","2026-01-12 08:10:11","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/the-need-of-mobile-business-apps/","0","post","","0"),
("658","1","2021-08-28 13:55:36","2021-08-28 13:55:36","<p class=\"western\">Shopping cart abandonment issues haunt every eCommerce owner. And we are not saying this just to scare a fellow eCommerce owner. Some data will give you an overall idea of how nightmarish the situation the cart issue is. For instance, the average cart abandonment rate across the industry is almost 70 percent. That 70 % causes about 46 trillion dollars of loss in the eCommerce industry, which is certainly a huge number.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The evidence is true, and data never lies. Hence, eCommerce businesses of all sizes and shapes are taking steps to reduce the number of cart abandonment issues. And the steps they took have produced fine results. Want to know how they are doing this? Of course, you are! But before applying the solution, you need to know where the problem is. Hence, this blog will offer you some of the most common reasons for cart abandonment. And if your business has those issues, take constructive steps immediately.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>High costs are the reason for 55% abandonment (taxes, shipping, and other fees)</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">No one likes to pay extra. If your products have higher tax, shipping costs, or other fees, the customer will try to ignore your business as much as possible. This makes it even worse if your competitors offer deals that are better than yours. And why would they buy anyway, if they get the same product without spending more. Would you buy the same product by spending extra even if you have a better alternative? We think the answer is obvious.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Users are becoming smarter, and they like to compare every time they make a purchase. And if your business can\'t compete with your competitors regarding the price, you have to look for ways to reduce the extra charges.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>34% abandonment issues are for forced account creation</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Forced account creation is something that does a lot more damage than you realize. Account creation comes in between the shopping experience, and it irritates customers. It is especially for those who are making purchases for one time. Hence, we would like to suggest giving the customers the option to do guest checkout.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Give them the freedom whether they have to make an account or not. Once the purchase is complete, then you can ask them if they want to get the update via email or not. To make it short, do not put extra steps in between the virtual shopping experience.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Slow delivery &amp; limited shipping options</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Ecommerce business success largely depends on the shipping and delivery experience. Customers like to have different types of shipping options, and they prefer on-time delivery. Here, the faster is better. This is why many e-commerce giants are working and have already introduced faster delivery, such as \" Same day delivery.\"</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">So you have to give your customers different shipping options. Let them personalize the shipping details, delivery date and offer them, different delivery providers. This gives the customers control over their shopping experience. And you can always bring some promo codes to reduce the overall cost of shipping.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Complicated, time-consuming checkout</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">A fully optimized checkout flow can change your cart abandonment issues in positive ways. A long and complex checkout makes the shopping experience dull. The pages you have should perform best, and there should not be any distractions before completing the checkout. The process should be simple &amp; convenient. Therefore, put enough resources to ensure the user experience has the best quality when building the website.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Check your shopping funnel, find out if there are any unnecessary steps. If there is, remove them ASAP.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Poor performance</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Website issues such as frequent crashes, poor responsive will always push customers outside. The bad performance will force the prospect to look for better alternatives. Therefore, test your website in detail and with time. If you find even minor issues, put in enough resources to fix that fast. Identify errors, weak points and fix them on the go.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Shopping cart abandonment has a significant impact on your ROI. Therefore, you have to take constructive steps to ensure the abandonment issues are not drowning your business. However, the above issues, if fixed, can reduce the number of abandonment issues. Hence, you can certainly take those suggestions and recover a lot of cart values.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Want to know more or looking for suggestions from the experts? We have got your back. Contact us to start fixing your cart issues.</p>","Five Reasons for Cart Abandonment in Ecommerce","","publish","open","open","","five-reasons-for-cart-abandonment-in-ecommerce","","","2026-01-12 08:10:03","2026-01-12 08:10:03","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/five-reasons-for-cart-abandonment-in-ecommerce/","0","post","","0"),
("659","1","2021-09-03 14:33:16","2021-09-03 14:33:16","<p class=\"western\">WordPress is one of the most used CMS or content management systems available out there. More than 60% of websites on the internet today run on WordPress. However, in the beginning, the CMS was not built to manage the website. Instead, the primary thought was to make a reliable and easy-to-use blogging platform. However, it has evolved ever since. And today, it has gained huge momentum, and millions of people use this platform every single day.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">WordPress enables even a novice to make a website according to their needs and wants. This easy use and flexibility give the platform its\' recognition. However, there\'s more than that. There are numerous other benefits than meets the eyes. Today, we have gathered some of the top essential reasons why a small business must choose WordPress CMS for its online presence.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>WordPress Is Totally Free</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">WordPress is open source which makes the platform free to use and make changes. This is a significant factor for a small business or startup. Online presence is essential; however, spending a hefty amount on building a custom solution is advisable for a small business. So you have to undercut critical things to make it happen.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">However, WordPress allows the business owner to own a free website. And if you have time, you can build it. However, the best way to approach this is to go through professional WordPress developers like Elvira Infotech. We are proficient in WordPress development, and our charges won\'t put a dent in your budget.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>SEO-Friendly</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The need for a website for your business is essential. But that\'s not all. Prospects must find your website to do business with. However, building a strong online presence is not easy. It needs resources and expertise. WordPress websites can help you hugely in this regard. WordPress strictly adheres to SEO standards and principles. The WordPress codebase is clean and consistent. Hence, Google spider can pick your website very easily. The platform even allows you to update meta content easily.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Many easy-to-use plugins also help boost the SEO score, enabling you to compete with your business rival efficiently.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Plugins &amp; community</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Functionalities and flexibilities are two things that you need for a scalable website. WordPress has a multitude of plugins that are easy to install and work flawlessly. The plugins tremendously improve the functionalities and give a simple way to improve the existing functions. Besides this, WordPress has a huge community base, and the numbers have been growing rapidly.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Having a vast community ensures continuous updates on the project, security fixes and help to troubleshoot problems. The community base is highly active, and if you face any problem, ask, and we are confident you will get the right solution.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Mobile-Friendly &amp; Responsive</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Mobile or smartphones play a crucial role in the success of the business. Most internet footfall comes through a mobile device. And if your website is not mobile-friendly, then you will face a lot of issues. Google does not like non-optimized websites.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Hence, it will affect your ranking. If you are a website owner, you must think of making the website mobile responsive. Gladly you do not need to spend money, which is excellent for a startup or a small business owner. Most of the websites built in the website are mobile responsive that can function very well in different websites.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The need for a website for your business is absolute. And you can get it without spending a lot with the help of yourself. If you believe you have to put a lot of effort and time into the process, we can help you to reach your goals. We are a web development company with years of experience in the development field. And we can build the perfect, functional, responsive, and scalable website for you within your budget. You take care of your business, and we will</p>","Why Wordpress is Best for Small Business","","publish","open","open","","why-wordpress-is-best-for-small-business","","","2026-01-12 08:09:54","2026-01-12 08:09:54","","0","https://elviranew.elvirainfotech.live/why-wordpress-is-best-for-small-business/","0","post","","0");

