("782","1","2022-01-14 14:29:23","2022-01-14 14:29:23","As competition in the website builder software market is growing, finding the best one to suit your needs can be difficult. Top website builders like Squarespace, WIX.com, Shopify, Zoho, Weebly, and many others bring out so many reasonable offers and features; which one should you pick? Confused? Don\'t be; we are here to help! Below find the top website builder for 2022.\r\n\r\nWhile you are thinking of developing a website, make sure to learn the <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/secrets-of-building-a-seo-optimized-website/\">secrets of building a good SEO-optimized website</a> for better visibility!\r\n\r\n<b>Squarespace:</b> Casalena began developing Squarespace for his personal use while attending the University of Maryland. However, today it\'s more than a personal project. It has grown to become a sophisticated platform to build a website. Squarespace is not merely a website builder but a total content management system. If you want a website to look professional right from the beginning, then Squarespace can be a good choice. The platform offers numerous benefits, and they are stated below:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>It\'s easy to use and maintain.</li>\r\n 	<li>Coding is optional.</li>\r\n 	<li>It\'s mobile-optimized.</li>\r\n 	<li>Squarespace uses SEO best practices.</li>\r\n 	<li>SSL certificate security is included.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy social platform integration.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<b>Wix :</b> Wix is one of the better-known website-building platforms currently out there. It has a relatively good number of user base, and people are becoming more and more comfortable with this platform. Like Squarespace, it is too an all-in-one website builder. Wix offers users a free and premium plan to create a feature-rich &amp; appealing website. With 10+ years of experience in the industry, Wix websites have many pros &amp; cons to consider. They are as follows:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The process of building a website is easy.</li>\r\n 	<li>The platform is free to use for everyone.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy drag and drop functionality.</li>\r\n 	<li>Responsive design and optimized templates.</li>\r\n 	<li>You can buy domain &amp; web hosting here.</li>\r\n 	<li>Sites made with Wix are faster in loading.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<b>Shopify:</b> Shopify is a top website builder that enables you to list your products and sell online effortlessly. So yes, Shopify is more targeted to people who are keen to build a website that sells products or services. Shopify is outstanding for the online shops that sell goods or services that require minimal features. But there are numerous other features as well. And here is the list:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Quick Set Up and Easy Use</li>\r\n 	<li>Mobile Responsiveness</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy Payment Gateway</li>\r\n 	<li>Pricing and Affordability</li>\r\n 	<li>SEO &amp; Marketing Tools</li>\r\n 	<li>Abandoned Cart Recovery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<b>WordPress:</b> Give and takes above website builders are almost the same. They have similar types of features and face problems with scalability. WordPress is the best alternative if you are looking for something powerful with a unique feature list. This platform is so famous that more than 30% of the website is being operated using WordPress. And the reason is:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Ease of Use</li>\r\n 	<li>Opensource</li>\r\n 	<li>Plugins, plugins &amp; more plug-in</li>\r\n 	<li>Design of Your Website is 100% Customizable</li>\r\n 	<li>Extend the Functionality of Your Site with Plugins</li>\r\n 	<li>High scalable option &amp; more</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWebsite is a crucial part of modern-day business, and so does a website builder. Though every website builder promotes them as easy to use, it is truly not. For example, suppose your goal is to bring business through the website. In that case, it is better to develop the website with the help of a recognized web design and development company l