("1474","1","2026-01-12 08:04:12","2026-01-12 08:04:12","The ecommerce business is growing at a rapid speed. With this massive growth, the trend of this business too growing at a massive speed. Modern-day customers have become more nit-picky since they have a wide option to go. Everything should be good and follow the modern trend; without it, the business will fall apart. And it\'s not just a scare tactic we are giving you.\r\n\r\nAccording to a report published by Adobe, more than 35% of online visitors will leave the website if the website is not industry-standard or professional enough. And this is the reason why ecommerce business owners are always pursuing to offer the very best that they can offer to the users. Yes, it is difficult to manage a business and observe the changes in the industry, and therefore hiring a professional web development company is advisable.\r\n\r\nTo assist you in staying competitive in the ecommerce business, we present you with a list of the hottest ecommerce design trends to look out for in 2022.\r\n\r\n<b>Vertically aligned menus</b>\r\n\r\nFor years, being small or medium, every website was adopting a horizontal menu on its online platform. After all, in the beginning, the ecommerce website had a narrow focus, targeting the desktop user and using the screen real estate for the expanded menu. However, with the increased adoption of smartphones, the situation has changed quite a bit. And the data proves it. According to many studies, more than 60% of traffic is now coming from handheld devices.\r\n\r\nSo, the ecommerce website must adapt to the mobile device. The clear answer is to make the website responsive to fit any screen. But it soon became obvious that many horizontal menus donâ€™t work nicely on small mobile screens. Because of this, you may have seen a growing number of ecommerce business owner implementing vertically aligned menus.\r\n\r\nThe layout is very important for any website. Layout assists in maintaining the data flow of the website. The more attractive and functional it is, it serves the users better. Thus, many prefer to stick with big names such as Shopify as they offer a wide range of standard premade templates. But the problem here is, thousands of entrepreneurs use this because it\'s easy to set up and inexpensive. So there\'s no uniqueness about the website you own.\r\n\r\nBy hiring a custom web development company, many ecommerce businesses are implementing unconventional layouts on their website. And many of them are breaking the internet with this unconventional design and, of course, bringing a lot more users! Their platforms, application, and web pages have well-curated feature-rich themes with added gallery andth infinite scroll. Some of the websites is more interactive and has shared informative videos and animated photos. The moral of the story is to be unique and make your website more interesting. The more users engage with the website, the better, the higher brand retention and that increased conversion rate.","The top ecommerce design trends for 2022","","inherit","closed","closed","","832-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:04:12","2026-01-12 08:04:12","","832","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1474","0","revision","","0"),
("1475","1","2026-01-12 08:04:17","2026-01-12 08:04:17","Why is cross-platform app development so popular among app developers and business owners? Well, we have listed the most notable benefits in this blog. Happy reading!\r\n\r\nDifferent people have different choices and needs. But their choice should not affect how you deliver them convenience. Irrespective of the smartphone your prospectuses, a cross-platform app gives the entrepreneur the flexibility to own an app that supports different platforms. But this is just an oversimplification of incredible technology.\r\n\r\nThe <span style=\"color: #0563c1;\"><u><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/the-need-of-mobile-business-apps/\">need of mobile business Apps</a></u></span> are many. But to better appreciate this particular fantastic development, let\'s explore some of the benefits of Cross-platform Apps.\r\n\r\n<b>Codes can be reused</b>- The cross-platform development framework is a boon for reducing repetitive work. The same code is utilized for making the App for different platforms. This reduces the time of app development and reduces the labor cost significantly. The cross-platform development framework also makes it easier to fix or resolve any bug and add features seamlessly. To make this short, this is the best way to maintain the uniformity of your App in different platforms efficiently.\r\n\r\n<b><span style=\"color: #0e101a;\">Cost reduction:</span></b>Â A native App requires a specific code base and won\'t be able to run on a different platform. On the other hand, the cross-platform App codes are designed to work on different platforms. Furthermore, as we discussed above, being reused code, this particular setup reduces project time and repeated work. All of these end up a great way to reduce the average production and maintenance cost of the Application.\r\n\r\n<b>Wider market reach-</b> As a result of supporting multiple platforms, the products can be created and publicized for various app stores simultaneously. Thus, your product or services have a higher reach and a more significant chance of an increase in popularity.\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"color: #0e101a;\">Consistency:</span></b><span style=\"color: #0e101a;\">Â Having just a single codebase that works on numerous platforms greatly benefits keeping uniformity in the design. In addition, guaranteeing a consistent look &amp; feel and matching operation (UI/UX) of the app across all the platforms is a much more streamlined process.</span></span></span>\r\n\r\n<b>Reduce upfront expenses-</b> You cannot make anything from an app if it is not released. Lowering the upfront price decreases any risks taken. With a cross-platform app, it is much more effortless and swifter to get an initial version prepared and to see how it is perceived on the market.\r\n\r\nThe cross-platform development framework is a fantastic way to reach a broad audience. And as you can see, there are significant long-term benefits of having a cross-platform App. So if you are convinced of owning a great App, get in touch with the industry leader now!","5 BENEFITS OF CROSS-PLATFORM MOBILE APP DEVELOPMENT","","inherit","closed","closed","","828-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:04:17","2026-01-12 08:04:17","","828","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1475","0","revision","","0"),
("1476","1","2026-01-12 08:04:23","2026-01-12 08:04:23","The online shopping industry has been growing at an incredible rate, and so have ecommerce challenges. Ecommerce or online shopping business has been growing steadily since its inception. And with the extraordinary growth comes an increased number of challenges as well. Therefore, a business owner must understand these challenges and apply the solution to ensure your business survives in this highly competitive market. Yes, you may follow our previous blog <span style=\"color: #0563c1;\"><u><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/5-essential-points-to-consider-before-launching-an-e-commerce-website/\">about 5 Essential Points to Consider before Launching an E-commerce Website</a></u></span>. But what about the challenges afterwards?\r\n\r\nTo help you, we have made a list of common ecommerce problems that an entrepreneur faces and solutions you can try:\r\n\r\n<b>Cyber &amp; Data Security</b>\r\n\r\nWhen it comes to eCommerce, one of the biggest challenges faced is security breaches. There is a lot of information/data that is involved while dealing with eCommerce, and a technical issue with data can cause severe damage to the retailerâ€™s daily operations as well as brand image.\r\n\r\nOne of the biggest challenges ecommerce businesses faces is a security breach. A Successful ecommerce business stores a lot of data on its server. In the event of a security breach, this data can be stolen and used to do severe damage to the brand.\r\n\r\n<b>Solution:</b> Be cautious and always use a robust backup system to keep your data safe. But before all of that, your website must be built by a well-experienced website development company. A good e-commerce development company uses the latest platforms and technology to develop online businessâ€”this help to reduce a lot of data breach.\r\n\r\n<b>Online Identity Verification</b>\r\n\r\nIf your ecommerce business has cash on delivery operation, you have to take serious steps to ensure the service is not being abused. You must verify users and understand if they are genuinely interested in making the transition or not. A user can use a fake mobile number to use the cash-on-delivery system to harm the brand and adversely affect the revenue.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<b>The solution</b>: Analyse the user activity. This can be how long the user has been on the website, how many products they are ordering, and the price. Make an automated call and ask the customer to verify the address. Use software to check if the mobile number is VOIP or not.\r\n\r\n<b>Shopping Cart Abandonment</b>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">For an eCommerce business, the issue of cart abandonment is like an epidemic. All businesses, irrespective of their shape and size, face this problem. According to data, online shoppers abandon their shopping carts very frequently. In fact, 68% of the time, they leave without making the transaction, and some stores even say they see abandonment rates as high as 80%!</span></span></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Solution:</span></span></span>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Nurture your customers via live chat.</span></span></span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ensure the guest checkout option is there.</span></span></span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Use SMS remarketing and email remarketing.</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<span style=\"color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Each business has its own challenges. Understanding them and finding the most suitable solution should be the goal of any entrepreneur. Without the solution, the business will lose a significant portion of its resources. If you own an ecommerce business, the good thing is that we have provided the solution to the problem. </span></span></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">And please remember, we have only discussed three common problems; there are more, and we will bring them to our next blog with a solution. In the meantime, if you are looking to grow your ecommerce business and trying to reduce the number of problems, then get in touch with the best ecommerce website development company-Elvira Infotech now. We offer a free proposal.</span></span></span>","The Most Common Ecommerce Challenges & Their Solutions","","inherit","closed","closed","","824-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:04:23","2026-01-12 08:04:23","","824","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1476","0","revision","","0"),
("1477","1","2026-01-12 08:04:31","2026-01-12 08:04:31","Multiple small companies, especially new small businesses, operate a lean operation. These businesses concentrate on needs and urgent affairs, only paying money when they must. So, itâ€™s easy to see why some business owners might think a website is a luxury item for their business.\r\n\r\nA small business owner might think a simple Facebook is enough for an online presence. But this could not be more wrong. Hiring a professional website development company truly brings a lot more benefits to the business, and here are a few of them. But before we do that, you may take some time to get free <span style=\"color: #0563c1;\"><u><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/time-management-tips-for-small-businesses/\">time management tips for small businesses</a></u></span>, this can further help you to boost productivity and ROI.\r\n\r\n<b>5 reasons you need a small business website</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Welcome mattress</b>\r\n\r\nA website is more than an online presence. Fundamentally, itâ€™s the business\'s gateway, door, and welcome mat. It should familiarize the customer as well as elicit emotion. It is the very first image that will be made on the customer and can decide with certainty whether the client will continue engagement.\r\n\r\n<b>Increase in Business Credibility</b>\r\n\r\nAccording to numerous studies, more than 80% of todayâ€™s consumers think the business website is essential for building trust in the brand. A website makes the business more credible and boosts trustworthiness than other companies that only have social media profiles as an online presence. The website is also a convenient place to present any professional certifications or awards your business has.\r\n\r\n<b>Expands your physical location</b>\r\n\r\nWebsites made by professional web development companies are one of the best investments you can make. Want to know why? Well, when you operate from a single physical location, your presence gets restricted to the location. With a professional-looking website, you get the capability to serve the needs of customers across the globe. You get customers and foreign investment opportunities or suppliers, and they would never have found you if you didn\'t have a website.\r\n\r\n<b>Show your creativity</b>\r\n\r\nPresentation plays an essential role if you like somebody to purchase your products or services. This is essential, particularly if you are a small business owner where each client values. You can use attractive images, quick video tutorials, and downloadable instruction manuals. Customers get the materials they need to use the product and services in the best way. So, they remain with you and go nowhere else to buy. It offers you creative freedom and ultimately enables you to establish a loyal customer base.\r\n\r\n<b>Always available</b>\r\n\r\nHaving a website means you are serving the customers 24/7. Your prospects can always look at the website, browse through the products and purchase the things you need. Therefore, you are just not limited to conventional business time. The more you serve, the more ROI opportunities you get.\r\n\r\nHaving a professionally designed, brand-differentiating website is critical to surviving in the digital time. Opting out means loss of profit and customer satisfaction. SO, what are you waiting for? Get yourself a website that serves your business from professionals at Elvira Infotech.","5 reasons you need a small business website","","inherit","closed","closed","","813-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:04:31","2026-01-12 08:04:31","","813","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1477","0","revision","","0"),
("1478","1","2026-01-12 08:05:14","2026-01-12 08:05:14","Smartphones and mobile apps are everywhere. The apps have become the way users shop and interact with a brand. And considering <span style=\"color: #0563c1;\"><u><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/benefits-of-mobile-apps-for-business/\">the benefits of mobile apps for business</a></u></span>, every entrepreneur must invest in one for successive business growth. However, mobile app development isn\'t an easy job and requires a good investment if you are trying to get the best.\r\n\r\nBut there\'s a way you can spend a little yet get a highly sophisticated and feature-rich mobile app. How? Well, the answer is hiring an offshore mobile app development company. Why? Letâ€™s discuss the benefits of why outsourcing mobile app development is a good idea.\r\n\r\n<b>Cost advantage: </b>Outsourcing your mobile app development project can help you to reduce your overall app development expenses. It will decrease your overhead expenses but furthermore assists you in making savings on infrastructure and valuable resources.\r\n\r\nIn fact, according to industry professionals, offshore mobile app development can reduce costs up to 75%! And according to statistics, more than 50% of business owners are already outsourcing because of its massive cost-cutting benefits.\r\n\r\nNow, isnâ€™t that a good enough reason to hire an offshore app development company?\r\n\r\n<b>Greater efficiency:</b> An offshore mobile app development company like Elvira Infotech has everything to build and offer you a smooth, secure, and feature-rich app. You can get a dedicated team of app developers and state-of-the-art equipment for your project without breaking the bank! The human and technical resources are already there to deliver exceptionally high-quality work.\r\n\r\n<b>Efficient management:</b> As mentioned above, offshore app development companies have existing infrastructure. In addition, essential tools such as workflow management systems efficiently facilitate timely and faster delivery of projects while following the deadlines. Therefore, this enables them to manage their team effortlessly and deliver a proper good feel of business automation.\r\n\r\n<b>Long-time support:</b> Once you have the app, it\'s not the end of your project. In fact, it is just the start of a long-time adventure. Hence, your offshore app development company will also offer you regular support and service even after the development work of your business app is complete.\r\n\r\nWhether you develop an Android or iOS, the offshore development company will do everything from correcting the bugs, adding new features to marketing, and launching it. It makes the app development process efficient and active.\r\n\r\nWith the growing use of smartphones and mobile applications, it has become essential for every business to exist on the web and mobile phones to reach their target users. Especially nowadays, everything is becoming online, and users prefer that way.","Offshore mobile app development benefits","","inherit","closed","closed","","810-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:05:14","2026-01-12 08:05:14","","810","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1478","0","revision","","0"),
("1479","1","2026-01-12 08:05:19","2026-01-12 08:05:19","<span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><strong>What is Metaverse?</strong>\r\n\r\nMetaverse is the new sensation and buzzword. For </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><b>website development company</b></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"> like us, it brings a lot of new opportunities &amp; possibilities! While we start talking about its benefits and applications, we need to understand clearly what it is about. When talking about the Metaverse, we must keep in mind that it\'s not a stand-alone platform.Â </span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">Metaverse is the amalgamation of virtual reality (VR) and augmented reality (AR). Both make this a three-dimensional platform. It is a self-sustaining, infinite, real-time, and persistent universe with unique and fantastic features.\r\n\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>Here are the top three possible benefits of the Metaverse</b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><b>Great tool for healthcare professionals</b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">As a </span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><b>website development company</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">, we know how health care is utilizing the digital era as much as possible. However, web 2.0 is still not ready yet to help healthcare professionals. However, the advent of Metaverse can be a boon if utilized right away.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">Medical staff can visit the patient without worrying about geographical restrictions. In the virtual world of the Metaverse, they can seamlessly interact with the patient and have a clear understanding of their health condition.\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><b>Consumers can test products</b></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">You can </span><span style=\"color: #0563c1;\"><u><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/how-to-promote-generate-sales-on-your-ecommerce-brand-other-than-social-media/\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">promote &amp; generate sales on your eCommerce brand other than social media</span></a></u></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">. But that is not the end of it. Metaverse is bringing an amazing feature! The Metaverse can take window shopping to the next level for an eCommerce business. With the help of the incorporated AR &amp; VR feature, Prospects can now be able to test the product and experience it before making the final decision. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">This experience lets the users get first-hand experiences about the feeling of the products and how they will get value into their life. As a result, every business owner will be able to engage with their customers worldwide and be able to present their services and products without any inconveniences efficiently.\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><b>Visit Other Country Without Leaving Your Room</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">\r\n\r\nAs a web development company, we see this technology can help a lot to the tourism industry. They can use this technology more easily than any other sector. Right now, if we make any plans to visit somewhere, we tend to go to the good old internet and browse some images or videos. But once the induction of Metaverse, the prospects can simply put on the VR glasses and experience the place before going there. </span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\">This will help the customers as well. They will know beforehand what they are investing in. Furthermore, many the population can\'t visit popular places due to physical or financial troubles. So those people too can use this technology to visit their favorite places scattered across the world for their convenience.\r\n\r\nMetaverse is a new technology that requires more polishing in the future. But as a </span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"><b>web development company</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibre, serif;\"> we can see a lot can be achieved through this. And as a website development company, we are keeping a close eye on the development so we can use it for our clientele. If you require a Metaverse compatible website, then get in touch with us now! We bring tomorrow\'s technology today!</span>","What is Metaverse? What could be the benefits of it?","","inherit","closed","closed","","805-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:05:19","2026-01-12 08:05:19","","805","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1479","0","revision","","0"),
("1480","1","2026-01-12 08:05:25","2026-01-12 08:05:25","This era of social media brings a lot of opportunities for a business, especially for an ecommerce brand, to sell directly to prospects. However, overreliance on a single medium is not good for any business. The reason is not only missing out on other opportunities, but also your business is living at the mercy of the social media platform, which you do not have control over. Therefore, it is essential to utilize the other marketing channels as well. And here is how you can do it.\r\n\r\n<b>Optimize the brand website</b>\r\n\r\nThe website you own is a digital landmark of your business. Therefore, you have to take care of your own digital platform very well. Put enough resources to optimize it as much as you can to elevate the average traffic rate. For that, publish relevant data and make sure that the website you own is very user-friendly and easy to navigate. Moreover, learn the <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><u><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/secrets-of-building-a-seo-optimized-website/\">secrets of building an SEO-optimized website</a></u></span> to strengthen your digital presence.\r\n\r\n<b>Provide referral incentives</b>\r\n\r\nReferrals programs are a fantastic way to boost your customer base and increase loyalty. For example, you can bring out a good referral program where the user can gain a certain amount of exclusive benefits on completing the goal of bringing a new pre-specified number of customers. And if these new customers like your products or services, they can also be a part of an ever-growing referral program.\r\n\r\n<b>Choose online advertising</b>\r\n\r\nThe acceptance of PPC, better known as pay-per-click ads, has grown rapidly. It has significantly changed the current <b>digital marketing</b> landscape for eCommerce businesses. The PPC allows the marketers to make ads by analyzing the demography for their target audience. The best part of this strategy is you only pay if a prospect clicks on your published ads. It is a great way to boost brand awareness, bring new customers, and elevate revenue.\r\n\r\n<b>Collaborate with local influencers</b>\r\n\r\nInfluence marketing is part of <b>social media marketing</b> growing very well with proven success. And if you can partner with a local influencer to promote your service or product, it can become a very profitable endeavor. Of course, you can pay a specific price for advertising your service &amp; product. The best thing you can do is to sed them review material and ask for honest opinions.\r\n\r\nThese are some excellent alternatives that you can make use of to make your marketing campaign more flexible. But, doing it properly with the help of professionals like at Elvira Infotech will undoubtedly offer you greater returns. So, what are you waiting for? Get in touch with us now. Let\'s explore the digital marketing strategy.","How to promote & generate sales on your eCommerce brand other than social media?","","inherit","closed","closed","","801-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:05:25","2026-01-12 08:05:25","","801","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1480","0","revision","","0"),
("1481","1","2026-01-12 08:05:31","2026-01-12 08:05:31","If you are a WordPress user and looking to gain a leg up in the competition, then here are a few WordPress web development trends that will prevail in 2022. Letâ€™s check them out right away.\r\n\r\nThere are many <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><u><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/5-reasons-why-you-should-build-your-website-on-wordpress/\">reasons why you should build your website on WordPress</a></u></span>. But, if you are a WordPress user and looking to achieve a leg up in the competition, then here are a few WordPress web development trends that will help you to stay ahead in 2022.\r\n\r\n<b>Artificial intelligence</b>\r\n\r\nIn 2022, AI or artificial intelligence will gain momentum. Artificial Intelligence (AI) is the most major technological advancement that happened that humanity has seen in a long time. Since its inception, it has changed the way it interacts and matures to the point where a lot of businesses can integrate this into a website to reap the benefits of this technology.\r\n\r\nIf you can utilize the power of AI in the right way, you can add essential functions such as:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>AI-powered analytics for valuable insights.</li>\r\n 	<li>Daily repeated tasks could be automated.</li>\r\n 	<li>Improved tracking &amp; consumer behavior for better marketing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThere are many AI plug-in available that you can make use of. As a <b>web development company</b>, we would suggest going for WordLift, Akismet, and Quttera.\r\n\r\n<b>Voice Search</b>\r\n\r\nVoice Search has become a popular and convenient choice for users, especially ordering products or booking any services online. Therefore, riding this trend and integrating the voice search function into the WordPress website is crucial. Smart home devices such as Google Home, Alexa, Apple HomePod, and much more gained significant momentum last few years.\r\n\r\nTherefore, people are more leaning towards voice rather traditional way of typing. It is crucial to recognize current user behavior when developing your WordPress website. Integrate voice feature as well as make your content easy to read by voice search apps. This process will undoubtedly take some time but is definitely worth everything. While you are integrating voice search, make sure you work on this too:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Use a WordPress theme that is lightning fast.</li>\r\n 	<li>Keep your content clear to understand.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fill the blanks with schema markup in your content.</li>\r\n 	<li>Optimize your website to appear in Featured Snippets.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<b>Page Builders Will Rule The Roost</b>\r\n\r\nThe best WordPress <b>development companies</b> worldwide say that full site editing features and drag and drop builders have made users very comfortable in recent years. It is convenient for web development companies and users who are not tech-savvy. And this fantastic user-friendly feature will grow, and the acceptance of this will increase in 2022 and beyond. Now you can build a safe and feature-rich website without extensive code knowledge.\r\n\r\nWith easy use drag &amp; drop feature, users now effortlessly drag &amp; drop their preferred boxes, modules, or features into their preferred design layouts, saving a lot of resources. This is good for the business owner and the WordPress developers.\r\n\r\n<b>Website development</b> trends constantly change. And there is always room for improvement to make the website much more accessible and feature-rich. The abovementioned trends are just three of many yet major trends that will be prevalent in 2022. And we will keep sharing the updates! In the meantime, you can contact the <b>best website development company</b> to integrate all the above features and a lot more!","Emerging WordPress Trends To Follow In 2022","","inherit","closed","closed","","796-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:05:31","2026-01-12 08:05:31","","796","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1481","0","revision","","0"),
