("1492","1","2026-01-12 08:09:11","2026-01-12 08:09:11","<p class=\"western\">Unless your eCommerce store is combined with the latest functionalities and features, possibilities are the conversion rate is not up to the mark. If the low conversion is the reason you are looking to redesign your online store, it\'s a great decision. However, the process is not easy and is full of challenges. To reduce the number of possible mistakes, we share some of the best design aspects you can consider to lower the risk and boost ROI.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Donâ€™t Discard all the Existing Elements</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Some of your website elements should stay at it. A complete overhaul is not necessary. In fact, it could bring a lot of adverse effects. Before talking to the professional design team, make sure you collect the data about which element of your website is working flawlessly.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The best way to do this is to use a tool to track user behavior or their journey. Then, depending on the data, change the elements. Keep what is working and change what is not.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Competitor Analysis</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Competitor analysis plays a very crucial factor in the success of your business. Keeping an eye on your competitor always helps you play your card well and stay ahead in the business niche. Study your competitor\'s business website carefully. Find out what is working and find out why they are performing.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">While you do not have to copy all the elements of the site, you can always take notes of what feature is offering the best convenience to the users. If the prospect feels it is helpful, then they will definitely love to interact with your website.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Advanced Site Search Functionality</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">If your site is old, it is possible that your existing search functionalities might be outdated. Therefore, it may not give the correct recommendations to the prospect. And possibly, the users are getting a bad user experience due to that.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">If you are redesigning your site, it is the correct time to remove the existing search box and add a modern search tool that helps the users in the right way. It will definitely enhance the user experience and boost conversion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Itâ€™s time to go mobile</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Most internet traffic, along with eCommerce users, comes from handheld devices such as smartphones or tablets. Therefore your site must accommodate what a mobile device requires, which is responsive design. Responsive design is meant to work on every mobile device and offer full usability. Making the user experience much more significant.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">If your site is not mobile-ready, make sure you start working on them. Then, if the users feel comfortable with your website, they will not hesitate to make a purchase.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Product Visuals and Details</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Your website design plays a significant role in upscaling your business revenue, it is true. However, you have to put substantial resources into ensuring that the product or service page looks amazing and describes content correctly. Your visitors have landed on your website to order products or services.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">And if they do not get the proper description or details, they will leave and never return. Therefore, make certain that the product page has accurate, easy-to-read descriptions that feature the product\'s benefits and usabilities.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">As you can see, redesigning e-commerce websites is more pure science than all the design glitters. Therefore, it is advised to take help from professional design service providers such as Elvira infotech. We have years of experience in making great designs that bring a positive impact. We have helped many clients to achieve their business goals, and we can help you too.</p>","Ecommerce Website Redesign: Essential Considerations","","inherit","closed","closed","","661-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:09:11","2026-01-12 08:09:11","","661","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1492","0","revision","","0"),
("1493","1","2026-01-12 08:09:18","2026-01-12 08:09:18","<p class=\"western\">For an aspiring developer and web development company, to offer a great digital platform requires selecting the right development framework is a critical step. The right framework can offer great success, and the wrong one will definitely be a bad result. Therefore, the process requires extensive research and technical know-how to pick the right one. Too much work? Well, don\'t worry, we did all the needful to give you the exact framework you need to build a successful digital platform. So let\'s look into those.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>React.js</b> is considered to be one of the most important frameworks today. The React.js is a library of JavaScript and is used to develop web applications and mobile single-page interfaces. The framework was developed by social media giants Facebook, Instagram as well as many third-party developers. The objective was to make an alternative to the popular framework Angular JS.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">When you are going to build a digital platform for a client, you must have to choose a framework that plays nice with other essential dependencies such as Ruby on Rails or .NET/C# frameworks.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">This framework has a large and mature community. And earned respect for its minimalist approach and rather a small size. So it offers the developers elevated freedom and flexibility. But of course, to work with this framework, you need knowledge and enough training.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Angular </b>brings numerous benefits to the table from both business and development standpoints. This makes it a lucrative platform to work with now and in 2022 or beyond. Itâ€™s one of those frameworks that can work flawlessly in correlation with many back-end languages as well as combine business logic and UI. It has effective cross-platform development, high quality of the Application, improved speed and performance, faster development process, efficient problem-solving patterns, and many more.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Angular is a great option for bulky app creation. It demands less development effort and grants higher performance with features. You can choose this framework if you are planning to build a large-scale application, real-time app, or native and hybrid app. Angular gives an elevated control and has the most secure client-side.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Vue. Js</b> is a relatively young framework designed to offer solutions that developers face while working with well-known frameworks like Angular and React. Most of the time, it is regarded as the direct competitor of Angular. And it has gained a lot of momentum throughout the past, and the user base is growing as well.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The framework is the combination of all the great things from Angular and React. So if you are looking to build a high-performance application or a fast platform, this framework will be able to deliver a promising result. This is why people looking to build PWA consider this framework and rely on it heavily.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Planning is essential for a successful project. It gives peace of mind to you and your developers as well. If you are a developer, you know what framework is and will be best for your project. And in the of chance, if you are a business person or individual looking to build a functioning, featureful, fast, and scalable digital platform, we have the best frameworks ready to help you reach your goal and needs. Get in touch with us for more information.</p>","Three best Web Development Frameworks to use in 2022","","inherit","closed","closed","","660-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:09:18","2026-01-12 08:09:18","","660","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1493","0","revision","","0"),
("1494","1","2026-01-12 08:09:54","2026-01-12 08:09:54","<p class=\"western\">WordPress is one of the most used CMS or content management systems available out there. More than 60% of websites on the internet today run on WordPress. However, in the beginning, the CMS was not built to manage the website. Instead, the primary thought was to make a reliable and easy-to-use blogging platform. However, it has evolved ever since. And today, it has gained huge momentum, and millions of people use this platform every single day.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">WordPress enables even a novice to make a website according to their needs and wants. This easy use and flexibility give the platform its\' recognition. However, there\'s more than that. There are numerous other benefits than meets the eyes. Today, we have gathered some of the top essential reasons why a small business must choose WordPress CMS for its online presence.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>WordPress Is Totally Free</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">WordPress is open source which makes the platform free to use and make changes. This is a significant factor for a small business or startup. Online presence is essential; however, spending a hefty amount on building a custom solution is advisable for a small business. So you have to undercut critical things to make it happen.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">However, WordPress allows the business owner to own a free website. And if you have time, you can build it. However, the best way to approach this is to go through professional WordPress developers like Elvira Infotech. We are proficient in WordPress development, and our charges won\'t put a dent in your budget.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>SEO-Friendly</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The need for a website for your business is essential. But that\'s not all. Prospects must find your website to do business with. However, building a strong online presence is not easy. It needs resources and expertise. WordPress websites can help you hugely in this regard. WordPress strictly adheres to SEO standards and principles. The WordPress codebase is clean and consistent. Hence, Google spider can pick your website very easily. The platform even allows you to update meta content easily.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Many easy-to-use plugins also help boost the SEO score, enabling you to compete with your business rival efficiently.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Plugins &amp; community</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Functionalities and flexibilities are two things that you need for a scalable website. WordPress has a multitude of plugins that are easy to install and work flawlessly. The plugins tremendously improve the functionalities and give a simple way to improve the existing functions. Besides this, WordPress has a huge community base, and the numbers have been growing rapidly.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Having a vast community ensures continuous updates on the project, security fixes and help to troubleshoot problems. The community base is highly active, and if you face any problem, ask, and we are confident you will get the right solution.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Mobile-Friendly &amp; Responsive</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Mobile or smartphones play a crucial role in the success of the business. Most internet footfall comes through a mobile device. And if your website is not mobile-friendly, then you will face a lot of issues. Google does not like non-optimized websites.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Hence, it will affect your ranking. If you are a website owner, you must think of making the website mobile responsive. Gladly you do not need to spend money, which is excellent for a startup or a small business owner. Most of the websites built in the website are mobile responsive that can function very well in different websites.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The need for a website for your business is absolute. And you can get it without spending a lot with the help of yourself. If you believe you have to put a lot of effort and time into the process, we can help you to reach your goals. We are a web development company with years of experience in the development field. And we can build the perfect, functional, responsive, and scalable website for you within your budget. You take care of your business, and we will</p>","Why Wordpress is Best for Small Business","","inherit","closed","closed","","659-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:09:54","2026-01-12 08:09:54","","659","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1494","0","revision","","0"),
("1495","1","2026-01-12 08:10:03","2026-01-12 08:10:03","<p class=\"western\">Shopping cart abandonment issues haunt every eCommerce owner. And we are not saying this just to scare a fellow eCommerce owner. Some data will give you an overall idea of how nightmarish the situation the cart issue is. For instance, the average cart abandonment rate across the industry is almost 70 percent. That 70 % causes about 46 trillion dollars of loss in the eCommerce industry, which is certainly a huge number.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">The evidence is true, and data never lies. Hence, eCommerce businesses of all sizes and shapes are taking steps to reduce the number of cart abandonment issues. And the steps they took have produced fine results. Want to know how they are doing this? Of course, you are! But before applying the solution, you need to know where the problem is. Hence, this blog will offer you some of the most common reasons for cart abandonment. And if your business has those issues, take constructive steps immediately.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>High costs are the reason for 55% abandonment (taxes, shipping, and other fees)</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">No one likes to pay extra. If your products have higher tax, shipping costs, or other fees, the customer will try to ignore your business as much as possible. This makes it even worse if your competitors offer deals that are better than yours. And why would they buy anyway, if they get the same product without spending more. Would you buy the same product by spending extra even if you have a better alternative? We think the answer is obvious.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Users are becoming smarter, and they like to compare every time they make a purchase. And if your business can\'t compete with your competitors regarding the price, you have to look for ways to reduce the extra charges.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>34% abandonment issues are for forced account creation</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Forced account creation is something that does a lot more damage than you realize. Account creation comes in between the shopping experience, and it irritates customers. It is especially for those who are making purchases for one time. Hence, we would like to suggest giving the customers the option to do guest checkout.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Give them the freedom whether they have to make an account or not. Once the purchase is complete, then you can ask them if they want to get the update via email or not. To make it short, do not put extra steps in between the virtual shopping experience.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Slow delivery &amp; limited shipping options</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Ecommerce business success largely depends on the shipping and delivery experience. Customers like to have different types of shipping options, and they prefer on-time delivery. Here, the faster is better. This is why many e-commerce giants are working and have already introduced faster delivery, such as \" Same day delivery.\"</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">So you have to give your customers different shipping options. Let them personalize the shipping details, delivery date and offer them, different delivery providers. This gives the customers control over their shopping experience. And you can always bring some promo codes to reduce the overall cost of shipping.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Complicated, time-consuming checkout</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">A fully optimized checkout flow can change your cart abandonment issues in positive ways. A long and complex checkout makes the shopping experience dull. The pages you have should perform best, and there should not be any distractions before completing the checkout. The process should be simple &amp; convenient. Therefore, put enough resources to ensure the user experience has the best quality when building the website.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Check your shopping funnel, find out if there are any unnecessary steps. If there is, remove them ASAP.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\"><b>Poor performance</b></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Website issues such as frequent crashes, poor responsive will always push customers outside. The bad performance will force the prospect to look for better alternatives. Therefore, test your website in detail and with time. If you find even minor issues, put in enough resources to fix that fast. Identify errors, weak points and fix them on the go.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Shopping cart abandonment has a significant impact on your ROI. Therefore, you have to take constructive steps to ensure the abandonment issues are not drowning your business. However, the above issues, if fixed, can reduce the number of abandonment issues. Hence, you can certainly take those suggestions and recover a lot of cart values.</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\">Want to know more or looking for suggestions from the experts? We have got your back. Contact us to start fixing your cart issues.</p>","Five Reasons for Cart Abandonment in Ecommerce","","inherit","closed","closed","","658-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:10:03","2026-01-12 08:10:03","","658","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1495","0","revision","","0"),
