("1505","1","2026-01-12 08:13:32","2026-01-12 08:13:32","Most people seem to get confused during the selection process of a sitemap. People without proper knowledge really struggle to comprehend the best solution. Now, as a website development company and digital marketing service provider, we would state that the choice of your sitemap selection depends entirely on the nature of the website. However, there\'s more than just the website type, here\'s the difference between XML and HTML sitemaps.\r\n\r\n<strong>What Exactly are XML &amp; HTML Sitemaps?</strong>\r\n\r\nHere, we will concentrate on two of the most popular technical phrases utilized in websites that not a lot of people are conscious of but usually encounter: XML and HTML. The acronyms stand for Extensible Markup Language and HyperText Markup Language.\r\n\r\nA sitemap is a list of pages within a website that is simply accessible to search engine crawlers or online users. Sitemaps take the form of texts or web pages. What they do is make it more comfortable for both the search engines and online users to discover pages on the site itself.\r\n\r\nLet\'s say that your website now consists of 15 web pages and a user curious to know about your business history. Rather than manually digging through every single web page, a sitemap will make it simpler for the user to find the data that they are looking for.\r\n\r\n<strong>Now, let\'s dive more deeply into the two types of sitemaps which quite common:</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>HTML Sitemaps: </strong>This type of sitemap is utilized to sort of arrange various parts and pages of your blog or site by hyperlinks. They are typically placed in order of hierarchy, and normally incorporate a description of each link.\r\n\r\n<strong>XML Sitemaps:</strong> On the opposite hand, XML sitemaps organize the sections of a webpage through URLs utilizing a unique format. If HTML sitemaps are readable by humans, XML sitemaps are \'understood\' by search engines.\r\n\r\nOne of the most basic responsibilities of a website administrator is to upload an XML sitemap to search engines like Google, Bing, and Yahoo which just goes to determine how beneficial knowledge of XML sitemaps would be. Not just would it enable your website to be listed promptly, but it additionally improves the SERP of your website when a particular keyword related to your site is searched for in these sites.\r\n\r\n<strong>Differences, Advantages &amp; Everything Else that You Want to Know regarding XML &amp; HTML Sitemaps:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>To make it simple, the distinction between XML and HTML is that XML attends a regular format - so you can handle the sitemaps for certain search engines including Google, MSN, and Yahoo. As for HTML sitemaps, because they incorporate URLs or links to inner pages, there is no one standard that digital marketing experts follow.</li>\r\n 	<li>The great thing about employing an HTML sitemap is that it provides your website guests a more comfortable time to seek for particular content on your site. Furthermore, an HTML sitemap enables your web pages to get listed by the search engines. It additionally helps up the ranking of your site on the search engine, depending on how the HTML sitemap is generated.</li>\r\n 	<li>What about the advantages of an XML sitemap? This kind of sitemap is more beneficial if your website has dynamic content, if your web pages aren\'t quickly identified by search engines, and if your site has a huge archive of content web pages which are not linked with each other.</li>\r\n 	<li>Whatever sitemaps you choose to use on your site, the great news is that you can make the job easier with the help of XML or HTML sitemap generators. Go online and look for a medium that will enable you to automatically produce the particular sitemap type that you require.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAt the end of the day, the success of your site lies in the number of return prospects that you will get - and making it more comfortable for both online users and search engines to look for the data that they need through sitemaps is a step in the right direction.","XML Sitemaps vs. HTML Sitemaps: Whatâ€™s the Difference","","inherit","closed","closed","","648-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:13:32","2026-01-12 08:13:32","","648","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1505","0","revision","","0"),
("1506","1","2026-01-12 08:13:39","2026-01-12 08:13:39","Designing a website is a delicate process that requires the amalgamation of both science and art. It requires exceptional expertise in the tech domain and on the other hand, the designer must recognize the users\' perspective, visualize their needs. The worst thing a website designer or website designing company can do is copying from others. Because every business website must be unique and must be developed in accordance with their particular business niche. However, there is a designer who does not take care of many aspects of making a good website. As a result, they end up creating dull, boring and monotonous websites. Here are a few of the mistakes:\r\n\r\n<strong>Table layout: </strong>Are you using tables on your webpage? Then leave this practice now. By using tables on the page, you are making the layout complicated. The most layout requires numerous attributes such as colspan, rowspan, and nested tables. Although it might not be difficult to design, the resource it requires to maintain is quite high. Most users find it hard to understand tables as they are supposed to read it in the sequence displayed in HTML, and the content within a table layout becomes very confusing when studying from left to right and top to bottom. HTML5 advocates dodging tables in page layout and HTML 4.01 forbids it. Presentation is kept separate from HTML when CSS is utilized, so the support and maintenance of tables in CSS is a bit more comfortable. The tables might prevent the flexibility of the page and affect SEO. These tables, further take quite a lot more time to load compared to the CSS for the same design.\r\n\r\n<strong>Infinite Scrolling: </strong>Scrolling is a common design element and used across numerous amount of websites, especially on the eCommerce website. The use of this technique solely depends on the goal of your site. If your goal is to showcase numerous content on the same flat webpage, then this functionality will work exceptionally well. However, if the users\' intention is to find a particular task or compare the choice, this can be a notorious user experience.\r\n\r\nIn specific job accomplishment, users do find grouped content quite interesting. A visitor may get overpowered if they find numerous information presented in a never-ending flat page. Hence, while you are implementing this on the website, make sure to understand and recognize the needs of a visitor first.\r\n\r\n<strong>Parallax Scrolling:</strong>Although parallax scrolling is extensively utilized and is a great function that leads to a loyal visitor, there are concerns affiliated with this well. Parallax scrolling may be the reason for a low valuation for SEO ranking as well. If the parallax website is one page of images, content, and good visual display it is OK. Nevertheless, if the website has infographics. i.e. image containing text, Google does not read it! This can lead to a substantially lower SEO ranking. It can be sorted by transforming the image content into actual text. The difficulty associated with footers should be taken into consideration as some users might be looking at the data accessible at the bottom of the page. Parallax web pages with pictures may take longer than normal to load, thereby making most users leave the website prior to the page actually loading.\r\n\r\nThe website design technique is the most crucial aspect of your businesses\' survivability. If you do not have the right kind, you will end up losing users, credibility, and sales. To make it short, you will lose your business and your goals. Hence, it is essential to hire a professional website designing company like Elvira Infotech in order to make sure everything is right on the track. And if you think it would cost you a lot, please have a look at this blog where we have talked about \"<a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/11/27/how-to-choose-an-affordable-web-design-development-company/\">How to Choose an Affordable Web Design / Development Company?</a>\". Happy hunting!","3 Website Design Techniques That May Be Harming A Website and Its SEO Valuation","","inherit","closed","closed","","647-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:13:39","2026-01-12 08:13:39","","647","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1506","0","revision","","0"),
("1507","1","2026-01-12 08:13:47","2026-01-12 08:13:47","If you are a website owner, then you realize without enough traffic, your website is meaning and purposeless. Who is going to purchase your products or read your content if there are no visitors? Most importantly, what\'s the point of owning a website if there isn\'t any traffic? If you have a page on the net, then you want to know how to improve website traffic. When building a website to sell services or products, one of the last things that you may think about at the very start is the number of traffic that it is going to draw. But in reality, it should be the very first thing that you must think about.\r\n\r\n<strong>Find below are some practical and useful ways on how to improve website traffic:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>If you desire to know how to improve drive more traffic, then you must have interesting, educational web content. Not a writer? Not a problem! There are lots of content writing service providers available to serve your purpose like Elvira Infotech. Just describe what you require your content to be written about. With a day or two, you will find your perfect article sitting inside your mailbox. If you are the one who is writing the content, then be certain to add updates and add something original and new every couple of days or weeks, or whichever you favor. Keeping your content up to date and current will make the guests feel like they are getting something new each time they attend your website, which will always make them want to come back for even more. There is not a better way on how to improve website traffic.</li>\r\n 	<li>If fresh web content wasn\'t sufficient, and you are nevertheless wondering how to improve website traffic, try presenting your articles to high DA article directories. This was an old method but still works, as we can see the <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/12/30/important-upcoming-2020-seo-trends-you-need-to-know/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>2020 SEO trends here</strong></a>. With an article directory, you will be capable to generate backlinks to your website, which will improve traffic by numbers you never thought were achievable. You can post as many blogs or articles as you would like. The higher, the better. But, they all have to be different and completely unique.</li>\r\n 	<li>Add the essential keywords to your website if you need to know how to improve website traffic. For instance, if you are writing content regarding how to increase website traffic, all you will have to do is place the keywords inside the content that people use to search for that particular topic. You can simply figure this out by doing so yourself. The top most used search engines is Google. Do research about how this search engine works and how it crawl the content very carefully.</li>\r\n 	<li>Knowing how to improve website traffic further involves meeting new people and telling them all about what you can offer them. The best way to do so is by making use of social networking mediums. When you are using social media platforms, you have to follow some guidelines. Like, being very direct regarding your business not always the best way. Do not post too frequent or spam people etc etc. Social media were originally invented to help people make friends. Although more and more people are finding great use out of them concerning their websites. All you have to do is post links to your website on your page, and like magic, the traffic increases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf you desire to boost your online traffic in an ethical way, then the above tips will come in handy. Juggling between running a business and making it popular is a daunting task. To save your precious time, you can always take help from a <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>digital marketing company</strong></a> like Elvira Infotech. Who has enough human resources and technical expertise to help you drive huge number of traffic, sales, and revenue?","Tips on How to Increase Website Traffic","","inherit","closed","closed","","646-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:13:47","2026-01-12 08:13:47","","646","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1507","0","revision","","0"),
("1508","1","2026-01-12 08:13:52","2026-01-12 08:13:52","It\'s incredible, yet true that, right now, there are more than 2.5 billion people globally own a smartphone and use it regarding over 250 times a single day, crawling through different types of apps. It\'s astonishing how mobile apps have changed every aspect of our lives. And itâ€™s been proven that a <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/09/09/5-ways-mobile-application-can-boost-your-business/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>mobile application does boost your business</strong></a>.\r\n\r\n<strong>AMP is changing the web app landscape:</strong> Google began the AMP(Accelerated mobile web pages ) plan about 5 years back. Lately, the search giant Google further stated that there will be a separate search index for the mobile web. This changes the mobile web trends - particularly from an SEO perspective and digital marketing perspective. Google Amp supported web apps will significantly load faster on portable devices &amp; decrease bounce rates in huge numbers. It will further help publishers with improved ad visibility and more visitors.\r\n\r\n<strong>The AR &amp; VR tech is growing:</strong> Augmented reality and virtual reality are not science fiction anymore. AR and VR apps are going to be the latest trend in the mobile apps world. Mobile apps developers for Android and iPhones have now been working on VR apps that assist the entertainment domain. PokemonGo is a standing model of the success of such an application. Although it\'s not required that VR will catch on so soon, AR is already making it big in the mobile apps world.\r\n\r\n<strong>Artificial intelligence:</strong> Beside AR &amp; VR, there\'s going to be a significant boost in the investment throughout the mobile AI sector. Through state of the art algorithm, advance analytics, and machine learning, AI will be able to offer exceptional insight to the organization, which wasn\'t possible before.\r\n\r\n<strong>Cloud-driven apps:</strong> The advent of cloud technology is influencing the way a user interacts with an app or the way developers build applications. Cloud computing now has completely integrated itself into the world of the mobile application. It makes mobile apps more convenient from anywhere and anytime - without putting a lot of load on the phone memory or space since these apps fetch their inputs right from the cloud server.\r\n\r\n<strong>Enterprise apps and micro apps:</strong> The prime goal of a dedicated business mobile application is to assist you to restructure &amp; streamline your overall business manners. A micro app, on the other hand, is targeted to serve only a particular role. These kinds of apps are essential for the benefit of businesses in today\'s world.\r\n\r\n<strong>Security Apps:</strong> Security is of utmost concern in this very connected world. According to Gartner, approximately 75% of the apps do not even pass basic security inspections. This covers a number of points such as login systems, access to external storage, etc. It can be simple for hackers or other adverse entities to utilize this if security is not given a precise thought during the development phases itself.\r\n\r\n<strong>Mobile commerce:</strong> More than 65% of overall internet traffic is coming from portable devices. Yes, you read that perfectly right. The dominance of desktop and laptop on the internet is over. So more and more potential prospects are preferring mobile use than browsers. This study is pushing entrepreneurs to move onto the mobile domain. Even mobile payments are now becoming quite convenient for customers.\r\n\r\nOther happenings in the mobile domain are the increase in wearable gadgets and IoT. Mobile apps development for Android and iPhones is witnessing a change from traditional - basic apps to apps that can do a lot more!\r\n\r\nIf you are interested to build a dedicated mobile app by adhering to the latest trend and tech without breaking the bak, <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>get in touch with us</strong></a> the best mobile application development company- Elvira Infotech now.","Mobile Apps and Their Impact on Our Future","","inherit","closed","closed","","645-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:13:52","2026-01-12 08:13:52","","645","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1508","0","revision","","0"),
("1509","1","2026-01-12 08:13:59","2026-01-12 08:13:59","<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">In the world of eCommerce, if you want to survive, you must have a feature-rich and eye-candy online store. Choosing a good website development company in this regard is the best option. Why not an off the shelf solution? Well, to be honest, they are not flexible and don\'t offer personalized brand identity, which an eCommerce website desperately needs to make sales. A professional eCommerce website development company, on the other hand, can build a site exactly to match your needs, requirements, demand, and budget.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">However, there\'s a catch though. If you search \" best eCommerce website development company\" in Google, you will see there are thousands of agencies out there. And, every one of them is promising the best results at the lowest price with quality work. Needless to say, every one of them won\'t offer you the result you need. So how do you choose a website development company that will materialize your concept? Well, we are here to answer that.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Here is a list of tips you should think before choosing an eCommerce website development company:</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Easy to use &amp; scalable:</b></span></span></span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Let\'s get into the fact. Not everyone is tech-savvy. So, you must choose an eCommerce web development company that can offer you support even after the completion of the project. Of course, there will be few jobs you have to do alone. However, to make sure it\'s easy for non-techy entrepreneurs, the CMS must be easy and simple to interact with. Along with this, the platform should be adaptable &amp; scalable enough to fulfil all the growing business needs and be able to grow along with your company in the long run.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Existing reviews:</b></span></span></span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Checking out the website design companies\' portfolio is essential. By going through your preferred agencies\' portfolio, you will be able to see their existing work. By doing so, you can clearly set an expectation. Besides this, go through their review pages or customer testimonial pages as well. Check for both positive and negative reviews. If possible, talk to their existing clients ask their experience with the eCommerce website development company.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>A rich feature list: </b></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Your online store is not complete without a variety of features that can boost the customer experience. List down what you exactly you and your targeted customer needs. Share the feature list with the eCommerce website development company. Ensure that the web development agency has the expertise to integrate those features on the website prior to getting into any contract. Few features like easy search and navigation, product reviews, wish lists, multiple payment options, integration with a shipping partner is common among eCommerce website.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Do the testing: </b></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Your e-commerce website requires must not contain any bug it should work flawlessly. Select a website development company where they prioritize the testing process and take this seriously. Generally, a good company tests its codes during the development work itself. And later by an entire testing team. So, ask your preferred agency about their testing process in detail. And during the testing process, you have to involve yourself as well. Only launch the website when they properly test all the aspects of the website since a buggy website can impact your business and brand.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>SEO optimized site:</b></span></span></span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A good website development company must help you in developing a strong online presence of your eCommerce store. An SEO optimized eCommerce website will drive quality traffic, and help you to boost your sales and revenue.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">If you find an eCommerce development company that can satisfy your business requirements and present all the above-mentioned features in the checklist, then you can certainly go for the same. A good eCommerce website development company can build a</span></span></span><a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/12/19/how-to-optimize-ecommerce-websites-to-increase-sales/\"> <span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span lang=\"zxx\"><u><span style=\"color: #1155cc;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">site that offers exceptional benefits</span></span></span></u></span></span></a><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">. And a smart choice in selecting a proper platform can help you in building a success story for your online business.</span></span></span></p>","Tips to Choose a Suitable Ecommerce Development Company","","inherit","closed","closed","","644-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:13:59","2026-01-12 08:13:59","","644","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1509","0","revision","","0"),
("1510","1","2026-01-12 08:14:07","2026-01-12 08:14:07","The world of display ads is raging to the point that it is projected to surpass search marketing, in terms of amount spent, by 2022. The reason for this fantastic growth is that marketers are concluding that they require to build brand awareness and give the user content earlier on in the sales method, as opposed to seeing online advertising as something to be tacked on to a campaign as an afterthought. They additionally would like to improve the number of times that they can come in contact with these customers. Given the demand for Facebook, in particular, display ads have grown a way to guarantee a more prominent frequency of contact between advertisers and potential customers.\r\n\r\n<strong>Why You Need It:</strong>\r\n\r\nThough Display ads have clear benefits and drive the much-needed sales a business needs, people are still struggling to comprehend their benefits. If you are one of those people who doesn\'t see the potential of display ads that much, then the next part of the blog will change your mind.\r\n\r\n<strong>They are visually appealing:</strong> One of the first advantages of display ads is that, since they consist of graphic content, they can be customized and styled to match the marketing trend and users\' links. Regular ads generally consist of normal and boring texts, restricting how efficiently and quickly you can draw attention and carry your message. With display ads, you can use images, audio, video, graphics, and your companyâ€™s branding to stand out to users and attract their attention.\r\n\r\n<strong>Audience targeting:</strong> Are you spending too much without getting any return? It is possible that you are targeting the wrong group of people or audience. A display ad run by professional digital marketing companies help you to reach only interested people. You have the ultimate flexibility here. You can choose to have your ads shown to clients with an interest in specific sections or have ads highlighted on related sites. You additionally have the option to use ad groups, depending on your advertisement goals. Audience targeting enables you to choose prospects connected with particular demographic classes, like location, gender, material status and age range. You can likewise eliminate specific demographic sections to prevent them from seeing your ads.\r\n\r\n<strong>Flexible budget:</strong> You have a limited budget for marketing, you will definitely love this part a lot. While most times, you have to set a fixed budget for doing marketing. In the case of Display Ads, you choose what and how much you spend on marketing. There\'s always something for everyone. An entrepreneur can set their digital marketing campaign budget as low as USD5!\r\n\r\n<strong>Better analytics:</strong> To understand if your digital marketing method is working or not, you have to analyse the data and find out if there\'s any loophole or not. If you were using traditional marketing, the possibility of getting accurate analytics data is close to none. On the other hand, digital marketing does come with a lot of benefits and one of the best is accurate campaign insight. You will be able to track every single aspect of your campaign to improve and enhance better results and revenue.\r\n\r\nTo conclude, display ads help your company by reaching a more targeted audience and in a more impactful way. Start taking the benefit of imagery and relevance today with this powerful advertising strategy today! <a href=\"mailto:info@elvirainfotech.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Contact Elvira Infotech</strong></a>Â now to set up most professional and deliverable display ads so you can reap the most benefits out of it.\r\n\r\nInterested to know how SEO can impact 2020? <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/12/30/important-upcoming-2020-seo-trends-you-need-to-know/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>This blog</strong></a> might help you to get the information you need.","What Are Display Ads? The Complete Guide & Why You Need It.","","inherit","closed","closed","","643-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:14:07","2026-01-12 08:14:07","","643","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1510","0","revision","","0"),
("1511","1","2026-01-12 08:14:20","2026-01-12 08:14:20","The website is a crucial element that has become highly essential for every business irrespective of its shape &amp; size. The main driving force behind this is customer convenience. Users are slowly moving toward complete online shopping experience. And if you are not offering your service and product online, you are and will lose a lot of opportunities. Owning a website, therefore, is a significant advantage for any business.\r\n\r\nBut, people do get confused when they look for ways to develop a website. Generally, not all entrepreneurs are equipped with web design knowledge. In such cases, it can be hard to determine whether you should hire expert custom web development service providers or you should simply go for basic development on your own. But there is a clear distinction among the custom and template-based websites. Here are a few reasons you should go for custom web development:\r\n\r\n<strong>Staying up-to-date:</strong> A website requires regular changes. There was a time when parallax was ruling the world of the web. However, the trend has been moved on and your website should do that well. You may have a trendy website, but how long the trend will go on? If your webpage is not regularly getting updated, your users will think you or your brand have gone out of business.\r\n\r\nMoreover, you have to accept the fact that trends are changing every single day and you have to follow the pattern. Now, if you are using a template-based site, you won\'t get that much flexibility. But, with a custom website, your limit is your imagination. Whatever the buzzing trend in the world, you can apply it to your website simply by reaching out to a <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>custom web development agency</strong></a>.\r\n\r\n<strong>Extensive options:</strong> You have probably understood that a template can only be built on a simple website. If your need is unique and you expect to scale up, your primary and only option is a custom website. Down the lane, a template website won\'t be able to match the tech demand from the modern world.\r\n\r\nTake mobile optimization as an example. People are using their mobile more than desktop to access a website. However, if you opt-in for a template-based design, chances are it won\'t come with mobile optimized. That means you will lose more than 50% of your estimated traffic. A custom web development service provider knows how crucial mobile optimization is. They generally develop a website that performs very well in every screen size.\r\n\r\n<strong>Complex features:</strong> Usually, a basic website can only pass data and allow basic communication. A growing business\'s website requires much more than that. You will have to consolidate very common features like online payment methods. For this, you will require to set up a payment gateway system on your website. Furthermore, you might need to provide online customer support. Since people are more prone to text rather than call. Such features can not be incorporated efficiently when designing through a template. Hence, if you want a professional website, you must go for <strong>custom web development agency</strong>.\r\n\r\nSo what do you think? Do you believe a template would do a good job? If you are still in doubt about whether you should have a website or not, you have to read this blog here. Want to talk to a professional about your next site project? Get in touch with the best custom web development service provider <strong><a href=\"mailto:info@elvirainfotech.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Elvira InfotechÂ </strong></a></strong>now<strong>. </strong>We are here available to answer your call 24/7.","Custom Web Development - Reasons You Should Choose It","","inherit","closed","closed","","642-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:14:20","2026-01-12 08:14:20","","642","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1511","0","revision","","0"),
("1512","1","2026-01-12 08:14:28","2026-01-12 08:14:28","<p class=\"western\">Just when we thought we are going to get the hang of it, something new pops into the world of SEO! It promises to make it so much easier and profitable. The same old story. However, as a digital marketing organization, we cannot ignore these changes for obvious reasons. 2020 is almost here and like previous years, this year is also going to have a bumpy ride for those involved with the SEO industry! To make it more acceptable, we have done our research and we will share that information. What\'s this data all about? Well, it\'s the prediction of SEO trends in 2020, exactly what you need! Once you finish the reading, only try to this by following the white hat SEO method, not black Hat. <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/12/09/differences-between-black-hat-seo-and-white-hat-seo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Why</strong></a>? Well, you can find more info about that here. If you are well aware of the white hat SEO practices, letâ€™s begin!</p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><strong>BERT</strong></p>\r\n<strong>What is BERT?</strong>\r\n\r\nBERT is Googleâ€™s neural network-based system for natural language processing (NLP) pre-training. This signifies that BERT is designed to help computers recognize the differences of language like people do.\r\n\r\n<strong>Impact of BERT on Your Site:</strong>\r\n\r\nBERT is an exceptional system that will stop showing your website content if it isnâ€™t the best fit for the user query or it will start showing your content if the contents are the best match for the query. Either way, we would say this is a good thing.\r\n\r\n<strong>Optimizing for BERT:</strong>\r\n\r\nAccording to search giant Google, you have zero to no control over optimizing BERT but should focus your efforts on people. Again, BERT is used for Google to better understand natural human language that is being used very often, so write and optimize your content by the people &amp; for the people! While this may not work, but as a business owner, you have to consider your prospect\'s preference right? Posting content that is meant for the natural language will definitely help to boost people to business engagement.\r\n\r\n<strong>Content Optimization:</strong>\r\n\r\nIt is the oldest trend ever and it will be followed closely in 2020. Good content writing should always fulfil something in the reader. It must impart something; be it knowledge, entertainment, or emotion. How well it executes this will decide the reader\'s ultimate impression of your writing, the vehicle for the information you\'ve just imparted. Carefully look into the keyword implementation to rank well. The days of keyword stuffing have long gone and as we see it, it\'s not going to come back again. So, manage 2 to 3 % keyword density and post only related content.\r\n\r\n<strong>Mobile SEO:</strong>\r\n\r\nMobile SEO is a thriving business as more people get their hands on smartphones. Mobile SEO values of around 10 percent of the market, thus it shows crazy to miss out on 10 percent of your market by neglecting mobile SEO. Mobile searching according to Google is the fastest growing form of search. And this trend will grow in 2020 with an increasing number of regular mobile devices. With this massive growth, search engines have had to think regarding adapting search results to this new type of audience. But how does this new form of search affect SEO in 2020?\r\n\r\nThe above list isn\'t complete. However, these three will be the most crucial player in the upcoming SEO trend. So, if you are comfortable enough to do this by yourself, then good luck. And, on the other hand, if you are not comfortable and need experts who can do the best work for you, <a href=\"mailto:info@elvirainfotech.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>get in touch with Elvira Infotech</strong></a>. Our specialist digital marketing team is here 24/7 to serve your digital needs.","Important upcoming 2020 SEO Trends You Need to Know","","inherit","closed","closed","","641-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:14:28","2026-01-12 08:14:28","","641","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1512","0","revision","","0"),
("1513","1","2026-01-12 08:14:42","2026-01-12 08:14:42","<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Own an eCommerce website? Not happy with the result? Well, you are not alone. Optimizing an eCommerce website is not a Childs\' play. Luckily, the difficulties can be overcome easily if you consider taking help from a professional digital marketing company. The common practice among many eCommerce businesses is link sharing. This may work well for content-oriented websites; however, you will never find a good success rate if you are selling products and services. The following are tips to help optimize your eCommerce website:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Never copy and paste the product description provided by the manufacturer. This may save you some time, however, the method will not boost your rankings. Original content helps to SERP ranking. Every product page should consist of a unique description or the search engine spiders will consider it to be duplicate content and ban your entire website. If you do not know how to rewrite, consider hiring a professional content writer service.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Your content should consist of targeted keywords. The keyword field must be displayed in the title tags, meta tags, and the body of the text as well. While you are updating the content, do not overdo it. If you put the unnecessary keywords in the content, you won\'t rank well and the quality of your site will decrease as well. Professional eCommerce marketing agencies suggest 2% of keywords.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">An E-commerce website consists of many pages and you have to put keywords smartly. Place the product-related singular keyword in the product page. Always optimize plural keywords on other SEO pages, for instance, the landing pages and home page.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Make sure your URLs are search engine friendly or not. You should have product names and keywords in the URL rather than IDs, strings of numbers, or other parameters. As an eCommerce web development company, we would like to suggest using URL rewriting software.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Make sure that you place all products within 2 to 3 clicks away from the homepage. People do not enjoy spending too much time on searching for products and services. Your products should be as close as possible to your homepage. Never bury your services and products in categories or subcategories.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">While you are updating the meta tag, do not clutter it with keywords that have nothing to do with your content on that particular page. Make use of 48 characters ( including spaces) for meta title and 160 characters ( including spaces) for the meta description.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Always use individual keywords for the description meta tags. Use a brief product description for the meta tag content on every product page.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Review works. More than 90 % of online customers read at least one review before making any purchase. Ask any professional digital marketing company and they will suggest adding a review section on the website. As an e-commerce website owner, you have to find ways to add new and unique content.</span></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Elvira Infotech is an <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>eCommerce web development company</strong></a> and digital marketing expert who helps businesses make money online by using SMM, SEO, and SEM. Find out the top 7 benefits of <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/10/25/top-7-benefits-of-ecommerce-web-development/\"><strong>e-commerce website development </strong></a></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span lang=\"zxx\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">here</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">. Want to talk to a digital marketing expert for your future endeavors? We are here available 24/7.</span></span></span></p>","How to Optimize Ecommerce Websites To Increase Sales?","","inherit","closed","closed","","640-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:14:42","2026-01-12 08:14:42","","640","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1513","0","revision","","0"),
("1514","1","2026-01-12 08:15:23","2026-01-12 08:15:23","More than 70,000 searches are performed on Google each second. More than 40% of global eCommerce goods consumers come from after making use of the search engine. More than 90% of queries begin from search engines. Do it the right way and you can expect twofold ROI! So, yes, SEO is an exceptional strategy that gets things done.\r\n\r\nSEO is a technique utilized to provide a particular website and its content more beneficial ranking in SERP. It normally tries to provide websites advantages over others, especially in those organic or crawler search engines. Organic searches mean you are not paying for the successful redirect; crawler search engines mimic the act of crawling through the web and following links through to their particular web pages.\r\n\r\nIsn\'t SEO an exceptional method? Well, indeed it is! But, like every great thing, SEO to have caught the eyes of shady people. And this is the reason SEO has been divided into two distinct categories today. Once is black hat SEO &amp; the other one is white hat SEO. White hat SEO or legitimate SEO used by a professional digital marketing company to boost SERP rank. This method closely follows the algorithm set by the search engine. On the other hand, black hat SEO manipulates algorithms of search engine listings with unethical methods to stay on the top.\r\n\r\nWhile \"black hat SEO\" makes use of unfair practices to manipulate listings and to beat others, \"white hat SEO\" concentrates on correct means of developing a website and its contents to promote it on the Internet much better.\r\n\r\nMany websites try to draw traffic and leads to their site by numerous methods like <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/09/16/the-top-3-marketing-channels-you-should-prioritize-to-maximize-lead-generation-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>PPC, SMM, and organic search listings</strong></a>. SEO is much more involved in enhancing profitability through the last method, \"organic search listings\".\r\n\r\nPay-per-click advertising, which entails the advertiser to pay Google or similar agencies only for the number of clicks an online advertisement banner generates and not for ad placement, may ride up costs. This happens when a large number of user base clicks on the PPC link, even if they are not interested in making a purchase!\r\n\r\nWhat SEO fundamentally does to reduce the power of organic search listings is focused on relevant keywords.\r\n\r\nIn the white hat SEO method, the digital marketing company works in accordance with the content team to create unique and quality content for the website. These contents are easy to read and carry business\' core values and help businesses to set a unique identity.\r\n\r\nTo begin white hat SEO, you must talk to your <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/2019/11/27/how-to-choose-an-affordable-web-design-development-company/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>preferred</strong> <strong>website development company</strong></a>. The first part of true SEO is by making a clean code, which is significantly easier directed more at producing content to the users of the website. A cleaner, more manageable code, helps search engine crawlers read the relationships and links between pages and keywords.\r\n\r\nThis 2nd step in the journey to \"white hat SEO\" begins from creating content adhering to search engine guidelines. This content will hold information about the organization, people on it, products and services and must offer every answer to clients\' questions. However, do not just put written words. If your website is full of text, it will increase the bounce rate. Professional digital marketing companies reduce the bounce rate by using infographic and interactive elements on the website so the customer spends more time within it and don\'t get bored soon.\r\n\r\nWith more marketers fighting for exposure, questionable SEO tactics will always be used by some. In the end, it will be up to the <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>digital marketing company</strong></a> to find it within them to monitor themselves, play by the rules and learn as much as they can about proper SEO methods. Always remember that search engine companies are continually searching for a shady website and digital marketing methods. If they find anyone practicing unethical methods, the \"red flag\' isn\'t far away!","Differences between black Hat SEO and White Hat SEO","","inherit","closed","closed","","639-revision-v1","","","2026-01-12 08:15:23","2026-01-12 08:15:23","","639","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?p=1514","0","revision","","0"),
("1515","1","2026-01-12 08:15:33","2026-01-12 08:15:33","<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The internet is full of custom web development service providers pleading to offer exceptional results. They all look great and they do the job of convincing people exceptionally well! If you are confused to choose the best affordable web design company, you are not alone. By following these simple tips, you\'ll be able to select the perfect <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>custom web design service provider</strong></a> for your needs.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>What is your expectation:</b></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> Make sure that you gather an ample amount of idea about how your design should look like by taking inputs from the competitor\'s websites. Having a definite concept of what you need will assist the custom web development service provider to build a website you\'ll be proud to have associated with your name or business. If you\'re uncertain to articulate your requirements and ambitions, both you and your website designer will become frustrated and your website development project will require a lot more valuable resource and time.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Review the past work: </b></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Professionalism is also an important consideration when you are out, searching for a <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\"><strong>custom web development service provider</strong></a>. Find out more regarding their technical expertise to decide whether they have what is needed to fulfil the kind of website your business demands. Maybe, you can consider the capacity of many other specialists offering low-cost web design services. Question about their levels of training and previous experience. For example, you can inquire regarding their expertise in SEO, convenience standards, templates and testing of a completed website before hosting the website. Pay attention even to items that some people consider minor when hiring custom web design services provider if you want to have the best website.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Know the CMS:</b></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> At some point, your website will require to be updated. Phone numbers change, you may need to update your website content, or you\'ll want to update your services and products. Do you have the expertise to handle those jobs by yourself besides maintaining your daily business routines? While you are hiring a custom web development service provider to do the development job make sure to let them know your preference. Because the CMS will be built upon your preference. A simplified CMS built for a rookie would require less resources and if it\'s built for the pro, definitely it will take more time and budget.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>SEO Experience:</b></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> We have said this before, and we are saying it again, you need a website design company who knows search engine optimization (SEO), as well as the guidelines of the different online directories that helps to build a strong online presence. You need your website to be accessible for possible clients, however, you also want to be sure your site doesn\'t get delisted by violating guidelines.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Code availability:</b></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> Ask your preferred custom web development service provider if you will own ALL the source code on your site and that it is hosted on your website. Otherwise, you can end up getting systems/services hosted by other companies that cannot easily be updated unless you pay extra.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"western\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">While you are out there searching for <a href=\"https://elvirainfotech.com/services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>custom web design services providers</strong></a>, you must establish an expectation from the website designing/development company or you will end up choosing an affordable web design company whose\' vision won\'t match with your needs. Hopefully, now you know what you must do to hire the best low-cost web design service, provider. If you need more professional help, <a href=\"mailto:info@elvirainfotech.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>get in touch</strong></a>. with the most reliable low-cost web design service provider Elvira Infotech now.</span></span></span></p>","How to Choose an Affordable Web Design / Development Company?","","inherit","closed","closed","","638-revision-v1","","","20