("1601","1","2026-01-13 07:07:27","2026-01-13 07:07:27","<h3>Job Description:</h3>\r\nWe are looking for a creative and detail-oriented UI/UX Designer with 3â€“5 years of experience in IT projects.The ideal candidate must be skilled in Figma, branding, logo design, and video editing, with a strong focus on delivering engaging user experiences and impactful visuals.\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Responsibilities:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Design and prototype web &amp; mobile interfaces using Figma.</li>\r\n 	<li>Create logos, branding assets, and marketing creatives.</li>\r\n 	<li>Handle basic video editing for promotional and marketing purposes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Develop wireframes, mockups, and interactive prototypes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure design quality.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Requirements:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>3â€“5 years of proven experience as a UI/UX Designer in IT/software.</li>\r\n 	<li>Strong portfolio showcasing UI/UX, branding, and creative design work.</li>\r\n 	<li>Proficiency in Figma and related design tools.</li>\r\n 	<li>Knowledge of video editing software (Premiere Pro, After Effects, or similar).</li>\r\n 	<li>Creativity is mandatory, with excellent attention to detail and problem-solving skills.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h3>Perks &amp; Benefits:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Permanent job role</li>\r\n 	<li>5 days in a week</li>\r\n 	<li>Bonus, PF &amp; ESIC</li>\r\n 	<li>On time salary</li>\r\n 	<li>Career growth</li>\r\n</ul>","UI/UX Designer","","publish","closed","closed","","ui-ux-designer","","","2026-01-13 10:33:58","2026-01-13 10:33:58","","0","https://elvirasite.elvirainfotech.live/?post_type=job&#038;p=1601","0","job","","0"),
